(152, 'Amulya Srivastava', 'amulya.sri02@gmail.com', '8115643261', 'Any Other', 'e468458eecfa086fb1330aa643e04e4f_resume.pdf', 'I am writing to express my strong interest in the  Front End Developer position . As a recent graduate with a passion for web development and a strong foundation in front-end technologies, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your team and help create exceptional user experiences.\r\nThroughout my academic journey, I have gained valuable experience in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, Bootstrap and React JS which has allowed me to develop responsive and visually appealing websites. Other then these I am in the learning process of some backend technology that includes Node JS and Mongo DB which will be much useful in my further projects. \r\n', 'true', '2024-03-07', '07:07:01PM'),
(153, 'Divyansh Gupta', 'divyansh180102@gmail.com', '9369818267', 'Any Other', 'b0fce9e403d76c746feefbb84021f426_resume.pdf', 'Hello, being a 6th sem B.Tech (CS) student of Bennet University, Greater Noida, I wish to work as an intern to learn industrial skills and brush up my technical skills as well. I have completed some projects ( details in resume) on my own which gave me self confidence to be an active and dependable  team member who can support the   organization in a constructive way. I wish to do an internship for the  sake of learning and further inhance my skills while working with the experienced professional . Waiting for your positive response\r\nRegards\r\nDivyansh Gupta,\r\n9369818267', 'true', '2024-03-10', '12:48:53AM'),
