(161, 'Avneet Kaur', 'avneetkaurshivani@gmail.com', '9696623522', 'Any Other', '4117a7d026d0b9a7b7ea869736206df6_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring team,\r\nI trust this email finds you well. My name is Avneet Kaur, and I am a final-year student pursuing a bachelor\'s degree in CSE at Maharana Pratap Engineering College. I am writing to express my keen interest in joining Digi Coders as a Web Developer or Intern and contributing to the dynamic work environment that your organization is renowned for.\r\n\r\nI am eager to contribute to DigiCoders as a Web Developer or Intern and am confident that my dedication, coupled with a fresh perspective, will make a positive impact on your team. I am particularly interested in Java, Python, Mern Stack, HTML,CSS, JS, Machine Learning and am excited about the opportunity to learn from seasoned professionals at DigiCoders.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the prospect of being a part of DigiCoders.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nAvneet Kaur', 'true', '2024-03-14', '04:04:51PM'),
(162, 'Badal Gorai', 'badalgorai71@gmail.com', '8709197377', 'Any Other', 'efb6f4aaea3dc2fb4c18be8ca159e655_resume.pdf', 'Is there any role for freshers?', 'true', '2024-03-14', '11:09:26PM'),
(163, 'Naman Kumar Singh', 'singhnaman320@gmail.com', '7017225589', 'Any Other', '20e2624769a783a0a86e57903532a1d9_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\nI am Naman Kumar Singh searching for a software developer job role. I have just completed my web development course from Masai school and have 1 year training experience from the same. I presently started working in AcmeInTech, Lucknow from March 2024. I worked on various technologies such as Java, Spring Boot, Hibernate, Maven, and MySQL, Spring Framework. Apart from that I have sound knowledge of JUnit, Mockito, Microservices, MS SQL Server, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React JS, MongoDB, Python, and one of the advanced distributed streaming platform known as Apache Kafka.\r\n\r\nPlease find my attached resume as well as GitHub and Portfolio links and feel free to contact me if there is any opportunity.\r\n\r\nPortfolio: Naman_Singh_Portfolio (singhnaman320.github.io)\r\nGitHub: singhnaman320 (Naman Kumar Singh) (github.com)\r\n\r\nHoping to hear from you soon. \r\nThanks & Regards\r\nNaman Kumar Singh', 'true', '2024-03-17', '01:21:15PM'),
(164, 'Rahul Mishra', 'rahul.mishra023rm@gmail.com', '8707665075', 'Any Other', '271ab717a2bf54c044fc8da6c3f15d8b_resume.pdf', 'Dear sir/ma\'am, \r\nI am interested in applying for the position of HR profile at DigiCoders.\r\nFor the past 5.6 years, I have been responsible for working and managing HR for various companies. \r\nI appreciate you taking the time to review my CV .\r\nLooking forward to hearing from you.', 'true', '2024-03-17', '11:11:37PM'),
(165, 'Prateek Tiwari ', 'prateek.tiwari21898@gmail.com', '9589548411', 'Any Other', '088a6b3de690ddd64722d7d6d10cb2e1_resume.pdf', '• Worked as a Software developerfor client IBM’s project ICCSAP(IBM content\r\ncollector for SAP)\r\n• Specialized in Linux administration, handling tasks like instance creation, client\r\npackage installation, and ongoing maintenance .\r\n• Automated archival and delete logs generated by different providers using log\r\narchival script in Python .\r\n• Implemented error handling mechanisms to ensure robustness and reliability\r\nin automated processes.\r\n• Integrated automated processes with version control systems like Git for\r\nefficient collaboration and code management.\r\n• Experience in containerizing applications with Docker and deploying them on\r\nKubernetes and OpenShift, utilizing CI/CD pipelines for automation and\r\nmonitoring/logging solutions for performance tracking and scaling', 'true', '2024-03-18', '09:16:20AM'),
