(177, 'Aradhya Singh', 'aradhyasinghgangwar@gmail.com', '7706954419', 'Any Other', '2e4b6b09b1cd31a723433e5ec5e81709_resume.pdf', 'The HR Manager\r\nDear sir/ma’am,\r\nI am writing to express my genuine interest in the Data Scientist/Data Analyst/Business Analyst position. With a background in technology and a deep passion for continuous learning, I am excited about the opportunity to transition my career into the dynamic field of data science and analysis with a visionary company.\r\n\r\nMy tenure at the Blockchain Research Lab as a Senior Coordinator and Flutter Developer has been instrumental in honing my technical acumen and leadership skills. Working collaboratively with a team of 45 members, I spearheaded various technical events, including webinars, coding sessions, and hackathons. Additionally, contributing as a Flutter developer in projects like the punctuality drive instilled in me the importance of innovation and problem-solving within a collaborative setting.\r\n\r\nWhile my foundation lies in languages such as C/C++, Python, SQL, and Dart (Flutter), I am impassioned by the transformative potential of data science. In pursuit of this transition, I have initiated my learning journey by acquainting myself with tools like Power BI, Google Sheets, and Excel, laying the groundwork for comprehensive data analysis.\r\nMy enthusiasm to explore the depths of data science is fuelled by a genuine curiosity to uncover insights within data and harness them to drive informed decisions. I am resolutely committed to furthering my proficiency and expertise in this domain. My trajectory involves rigorous self-study, practical applications, and ongoing skill development to excel as a proficient data scientist.\r\n\r\nI am confident that my technical background, combined with my unwavering commitment to embracing new challenges, positions me well to thrive and contribute significantly to the innovative endeavors.\r\n\r\nI am enthusiastic about the prospect of contributing my technical skills and transitioning into a career in data science, in a company known for its forward-thinking approach to technology. I am eager to bring my dedication, adaptability, and passion for data analysis to your esteemed team.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I am looking forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills and aspirations align with the vision and requirements of the company.\r\nRegards,\r\nAradhya Singh\r\n', 'true', '2024-03-22', '08:07:18PM'),
