(219, 'Atul Sharma', 'atul.sharma.123647@gmail.com', '8953555297', 'Any Other', '717926262d7823c859ce1da41324b60a_resume.pdf', 'Dear Sir/Ma\'am,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to express my interest in the Web Developer  position at your company and have attached my resume and portfolio link for your reference. \r\n\r\nAs a current B. Tech. student at Dr. A. P. J. Abdul Kalam Technical University, Lucknow, I have gained valuable experience in web development, specifically in Full Stack Development. I possess a strong command of various technologies essential for web development, including React, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Bootstrap, Tailwind CSS, MongoDB, Node.js, Express.js, PHP, Wordpress, Git, and Data Structures and Algorithms using C++. I can adapt to the new technology very fast.\r\n\r\nI have 2 months of experience as an Intern at Synthetico.ai as a  Software Developer, with a focus on building robust and scalable applications using the MERN stack. Throughout my career, I have successfully delivered numerous projects, ranging from e-commerce platforms to consulting websites, each tailored to meet the unique needs of clients.\r\n\r\nI also have done 6 months training as an Intern at Techpile Technology Pvt. Ltd.a as a Full Stack Development Intern.\r\n\r\nMy passion for web development has allowed me to build a solid foundation in both frontend and backend technologies. I have successfully completed numerous projects that showcase my ability to create responsive and user-friendly web applications and I am eager to contribute my skills and knowledge to your team and help you achieve your development goals.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I am looking forward to the opportunity to discuss how my qualifications align with the needs of the company.\r\n\r\nBest Regards\r\nAtul Sharma \r\nPhone – 8953555297\r\nPortfolio Link - https://my-portfolio-atulsharma.vercel.app', 'true', '2024-04-05', '09:02:12PM'),
