(224, 'Naman Kumar Singh ', 'singhnaman320@gmail.com', '7017225589', 'Any Other', 'b137a2b3279be7e6048490b1d6b8ac06_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\nI am Naman Kumar Singh searching for a software developer job role. I have just completed my web development course from Masai school and have 1 year training experience from the same. I presently started working in AcmeInTech, Lucknow from March 2024. I worked on various technologies such as Java, Spring Boot, Hibernate, Maven, and MySQL, Spring Framework. Apart from that I have sound knowledge of JUnit, Mockito, Microservices, MS SQL Server, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React JS, MongoDB, Python, and one of the advanced distributed streaming platform known as Apache Kafka.\r\n\r\nPlease find my attached resume as well as GitHub and Portfolio links and feel free to contact me if there is any opportunity.\r\n\r\nPortfolio: Naman_Singh_Portfolio (singhnaman320.github.io)\r\nGitHub: singhnaman320 (Naman Kumar Singh) (github.com)\r\n\r\nHoping to hear from you soon. \r\nThanks & Regards\r\nNaman Kumar Singh', 'true', '2024-04-10', '03:54:59PM'),
(225, 'Shantanu Srivastava', 'work.shasri@gmail.com', '7985691707', 'Any Other', '98f4720d8c142b6ed5939659fe628598_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Team,\r\n\r\nI\'m reaching out to express my interest in the open job opportunity at Digicoders. With a solid background in full-stack development and a proven track record of spearheading innovative projects, I\'m confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team. I bring expertise in AWS services, RESTful API design, and a passion for delivering high-quality solutions. I\'m excited about the prospect of joining Digicoders and contributing to its continued success.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nShantanu Srivastava', 'true', '2024-04-10', '09:03:11PM'),
(226, 'Kumud Maurya', 'kumudmaurya1903@gmail.com', '9565835152', 'Any Other', 'd434e1d30389baaae6936e8178b736bb_resume.jpg', 'Respected Sir,\r\n              I am fresher of .Net Developer with MVC and C#.\r\n              I have completed diploma 6 month Internship \"Techpile Technology \r\n              Pvt.Ltd.\"', 'true', '2024-04-11', '08:55:11AM'),
