(228, 'Himanshu Srivastava', 'Himanshusriv2000@gmail.com', '08299672371', 'Any Other', '677f6367aa55b23183797d37ea0f0e96_resume.pdf', 'Greetings, ma\'am/sir\r\n\r\nI\'m sending this email to apply for the position of \"software trainee\" that is currently open. The job and its duties appear interesting and aligned with my professional aspirations. I want to draw your attention to my main qualifications for the position.\r\nI\'ve included my résumé for your review.\r\nIf you grant me the opportunity to work for your company, I would be eternally thankful and would give it my all.\r\nI appreciate you taking the time. Both my phone number and email are available at all times.', 'true', '2024-04-12', '10:12:34AM'),
