(249, 'Vipul Giri', 'vipul.giri2003@gmail.com', '6394597286', 'Any Other', '72322191d811479bcafe56d3e2e168de_resume.pdf', 'Dear Sir/Ma\'am,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Graphic Designer, UI/UX and website designer Designer position at your organisation, as advertised. With three months of internship experience and six months of professional experience in the field, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your team and leverage my skills to help your organisation achieve its design objectives.\r\n\r\nDuring my internship at firstfunding, I had the opportunity to work on various projects spanning both graphic design and front-end development. This experience allowed me to gain valuable hands-on experience in creating visually appealing graphics and intuitive user interfaces. my internship provided me with exposure to industry-standard design tools and methodologies, further enhancing my skill set.\r\n\r\nFollowing my internship, I transitioned into a full-time role as a Graphic/UI/UX Designer at Xeloop Media. In this role, I had the opportunity to further develop my design abilities while working on a diverse range of projects. I was responsible for creating engaging visual content for digital platforms, as well as designing user interfaces that prioritize usability and enhance the overall user experience. I also actively participated in brainstorming sessions, contributing innovative ideas and concepts to project discussions.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I am enthusiastic about the possibility of joining your team and contributing to the continued success of your organisation. I am available for an interview at your earliest convenience and can be reached at 6394597286 or vipul.giri2003@gmail.com.\r\n', 'true', '2024-04-24', '01:36:09PM'),
