(267, 'Rama kant Bhargava', 'ramakantbbhargava50@gmail.com', '09878616117', 'Any Other', '0423258b0cc5cc70c45c252b52326e21_resume.docx', 'I am highly adaptable and able to work effectively in fast-paced environments, prioritizing tasks to meet deadlines and deliver results. My strong communication skills enable me to collaborate seamlessly with team members and stakeholders, fostering a culture of continuous improvement and excellence.\r\n\r\nI am enthusiastic about the opportunity to contribute my skills and experiences to your team and support your company\'s commitment to quality assurance. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with your company\'s needs.', 'true', '2024-04-27', '05:14:47PM'),
