(269, 'Utkarsh Sonker', 'utkarshsonker.21@gmail.com', '09555565080', 'Any Other', 'b5366eb826a00650ed4603c17c861ede_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Team,\r\n\r\nI am thrilled to apply for the entry-level software development position at DigiCoders. With a recent degree in B.C.A. from Kanpur University, I bring a good foundation in programming, proficiency in languages like Java, and hands-on experience with various development tools as mentioned in my resume too.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nUtkarsh Sonker', 'true', '2024-04-29', '01:23:09PM'),
