(274, 'Ankit Singh', 'Ankit971999@gmail.com', '8564090432', 'Any Other', '511a38ea10cc676eb687e8ac39e32a8e_resume.pdf', 'Subject: Summer 2024: Internship Inquiry\r\n\r\nDear Sir,\r\n\r\nI hope this email finds you well. My name is Ankit Singh, and I am currently a third-year student at Jaypee University of Engineering and Technology.\r\n\r\nI am writing to inquire about the availability of internship opportunities or references for this upcoming summer. I am eager to gain practical experience in our field and believe that an internship under your guidance would be an invaluable opportunity for me.\r\n\r\nI would greatly appreciate it if you could let me know if there are any internship openings or if you could provide a reference for a potential internship elsewhere. Additionally, I would be more than willing to discuss further details regarding the internship if you are available.\r\n\r\nThank you very much for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nBest Regards,\r\nAnkit Singh', 'true', '2024-04-30', '10:36:16PM'),
