(363, 'Pratibha Singh ', 'pratibhasingh3218@gmail.com', '7706819345', 'Any Other', '72e428bcaaf1ace0ea2171fa201f4dde_resume.pdf', 'Application For Web Developer - Pratibha Singh \r\nDear Sir / Madam,\r\n\r\nI am writing to apply for \"web development\" post in your company.The position and responsibilities seems exciting and matching to my interest areas and career goals.I would like to bring your attention to my strengths for the job role.\r\n\r\n# B.tech in computer science and engineering \r\n# Interest and knowledge in Web development.\r\n\r\nFor more information, I have attached my resume for your consideration.\r\n\r\nThank you for your valuable time. I am always reachable on my email and phone number.\r\n\r\n\r\nSincerely yours,\r\nName - Pratibha Singh \r\nMob - 8874657660\r\nEmail ID - pratibhasingh3218@gmail.com', 'true', '2024-06-08', '11:20:11AM'),
(364, 'Akshat Agnihotri', 'akshatagni1604@gmail.com', '6388890411', 'Any Other', 'cceae815c940373792c2a04d2ac16c2b_resume.pdf', 'As a recent B.Tech graduate in Computer Science and Engineering, I have developed a strong foundation in C++ programming and web development. Throughout my academic journey, I have honed my skills by working on various projects that have allowed me to apply my knowledge in practical settings. My projects have ranged from creating dynamic websites to developing efficient algorithms, showcasing my versatility and technical proficiency. I am now seeking an opportunity to contribute to an esteemed organization where I can leverage my expertise, continue to grow professionally, and make a meaningful impact. My strong problem-solving abilities, coupled with my dedication and enthusiasm for technology, make me a valuable addition to any team.', 'true', '2024-06-09', '05:14:38PM'),
