(403, 'Himanshu Kumar', 'himanshukumarn009@gmail.com', '9559665763', 'Any Other', '1b90da247fe7371224e6c8ab2904a571_resume.pdf', ' I am writing to ask for a job in your company. My name is Himanshu Kumar, and I recently completed my B.Tech in Electronics and Communication from Chhotu Ram Institute of Engineering and Technology, Meerut, in 2024. I am writing to express my interest in a Software Engineer position at your esteemed company.\r\n\r\nI have a strong proficiency in programming languages such as Java and JavaScript. Additionally, I have experience with Database Management Systems (DBMS) and SQL. I have completed a course in Data Structures and Algorithms using Java and am proficient in Object-Oriented Programming. During my college years, I worked on several projects that have honed my technical skills and understanding of software development.\r\n\r\nI am currently seeking job opportunities and am particularly interested in the role of a Software Development Engineer (SDE). However, I am open to any technical positions available at your company as I am eager to start my career in the tech industry.\r\n\r\nPlease find my resume and cover letter attached for your review.\r\n\r\nHere are my contact details:\r\n\r\nPhone: 9559665763\r\nEmail: himanshukumarn009@gmail.com\r\nI would be grateful if you could review my application and consider me for a suitable position at your company. Even a small assistance from your end would be a significant step forward in my career journey.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to your response.', 'true', '2024-06-27', '04:15:41PM'),
