(407, 'Zeba Sabih', 'zeba.saih@gmail.com', '7860868492', 'Any Other', 'd6c37a4a66d80588e59e8bd121b62abb_resume.pdf', 'Dear Sir/Ma\'am;\r\nI\'m Zeba Sabih, an undergraduate student of B-tech,in the specialization of Computer Science Engineering. I have just stepped in my final year of graduation. I\'m looking for an opportunity where I can implement my skills and gain hands-on experience with the tools and technologies in industrial level projects or in an organization.\r\nI am highly interested in Android Development and acquire all the basics to intermediate level skills required for android developer.\r\nI have knowledge of Java, Kotlin, Flutter, Firebase, REST APIs,Android SDKs, MySQL, SQLite, HTML, CSS and Javascript.\r\nI\'ll be highly obliged if you accept my request and would be extremely grateful to work within your esteemed company.\r\nRegards,\r\nZeba Sabih', 'true', '2024-06-28', '11:46:04PM'),
