(410, 'Ranjeet Kumar', 'cehranjeetkumar@gmail.com', '7599590744', 'Any Other', 'b07fdb6253d992a7c2619af659692adf_resume.pdf', 'My name is Ranjeet Kumar, and I am a 24 year BCA Cloud Computing and Cyber Security student at IIMT University Meerut Uttar Pradesh with a strong passion for Cyber Security. I am writing to express my keen interest in Security Researcher at Trancis\r\n\r\nDuring my BCA Cloud & Cyber Security Program, I have developed a strong foundation in Computer Networking Concepts, Cyber Security Tools Working ,Cloud Computing Services, Programming Languages, etc.. I have also honed my skills in Problem-Solving, AWS, Azure, Linux, CEHv12, CHFI , Analytical Thinking, etc. through Project The Rise of Mobile\r\n\r\nMalware, and Administrative Assistant internships, and Desktop and Network Engineer Working on DGCA HeadOffice Jor Bagh My Achievements as a Content Creator on YouTube with 2.8K Subscribers.\r\n\r\nSecurity Researcher I am confident that my skills and knowledge would be a valuable asset to your team. \r\nI am eager to learn more about potential opportunities within Security Researcher and explore how my BCA CCS background can contribute to your success.\r\n\r\nI have attached My Resume for your Review, which further details my qualifications and experience.\r\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you soon.', 'true', '2024-07-01', '04:12:56PM'),
