(422, 'Meenakshi Shrivastava', 'meenakshishrivastava676@gmail.com', '07037535226', 'Any Other', 'ee77d8c45c38156c352056e247f9ddac_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nMy name is Meenakshi Shrivastava, and I am a recent graduate with a Bachelor of Technology in Computer Science from AKTU university ,shri siddhi vinayak institute of technology. I am excited to apply for the software quality engineer position at your company, as advertised.\r\n\r\nDuring my studies, I have developed a strong foundation in computer science principles, including algorithms, data structures, and software engineering. I have completed several projects, such as developing a web application for ecommerce website and job portal website. Additionally, I achieved a 74% till now in my graduation.\r\n\r\nI have gained practical experience through internships at Nullclass, where I worked on real time applications. These experiences have honed my skills in Web development and MERN stack development and have prepared me to contribute effectively to your team.\r\n\r\nI am particularly drawn to your company because of work culture and opportunity to grow. I am confident that my background and enthusiasm make me a strong candidate for this position. I am eager to bring my expertise and passion for technology to your innovative team.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I am looking forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experiences align with the needs of your team. Please feel free to contact me at meenakshishrivastava676@gmail.com or 7037535226 to schedule an interview.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nMeenakshi Shrivastava', 'true', '2024-07-08', '08:07:33PM'),
(423, 'Krishna Gupta', 'kg983825@gmail.com', '6307006215', 'Any Other', '81d6b63ceade577245b10488bf3aee01_resume.pdf', 'I am excited to apply for the Software Engineer role. With a strong foundation in Java, React, MySQL, and JavaScript, I have developed robust applications and effective solutions. My experience includes full-stack development. I am eager to bring my technical skills and problem-solving abilities to your esteemed team.\r\n\r\nI am looking forward to the opportunity to discuss how my background and passion align with the goals of your company.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application.', 'true', '2024-07-09', '01:13:42AM'),
