(431, 'Ashendrakumar pal', 'ashendrakumarpal@gmail.com', '7768864045', 'Any Other', '8686181c7a1c2d887c32908cd2e34cf1_resume.pdf', '\r\nI have 2 Years of experience in Angular development.\r\n\r\nMy technical skills include:\r\n\r\nStrong proficiency in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript\r\nIn-depth knowledge of Angular framework (Angular 2+)\r\nExperience with TypeScript for building scalable and maintainable code\r\nFamiliarity with state management using NgRx\r\nExpertise in integrating RESTful APIs into Angular applications\r\nResponsive design principles and cross-browser compatibility\r\nVersion control with Git and collaborative tools such as GitHub\r\nWhat sets me apart is my passion for clean and efficient coding practices, as well as my dedication to staying updated with the latest trends and best practices in web development. I am confident that my technical expertise, combined with my problem-solving skills and strong teamwork, make me a valuable asset to the Company.\r\n\r\n', 'true', '2024-07-14', '05:43:33PM'),
