(477, 'Priya Mishra ', 'priyamishra14092002@gmail.com', '9580668189', 'Any Other', 'accd65f5ad0fab4572d5f6a2dc9269e8_resume.pdf', '\r\nDear Hiring Manager at Digicoder,\r\n\r\nI, Priya Mishra, am excited to apply for the  at Digicoder, where I can kickstart my career in coding and innovation.\r\n\r\nAs a recent with a strong foundation in programming languages, including Python, Java I possess:\r\n\r\n- Solid understanding of data structures, algorithms, and software design patterns\r\n- Familiarity with development tools and version control systems like Git\r\n- Strong eagerness to learn and grow with a dynamic team\r\n\r\nI\'m drawn to Digicoder\'s commitment to innovation and customer satisfaction. I\'m impressed by the company\'s cutting-edge projects and collaborative culture.\r\n\r\nDuring my academic tenure, I:\r\n\r\n- Developed personal projects, including Emotions Detection using python and Machine learning, Hospital Management using python and MySQL and Tkinter .\r\n- Collaborated with peers on group projects, honing teamwork and communication skills\r\n\r\nI\'m excited to apply my skills and knowledge in a real-world setting and contribute to Digicoder\'s success.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\nPriya Mishra\r\n', 'true', '2024-07-25', '01:04:54PM'),
