(488, 'Himanshu Sahu', 'himanshusahu2301@gmail.com', '9125227292', 'Any Other', '498278fce4903d5a2bf697600ee623dc_resume.pdf', 'Date: July 31, 2024\r\nDear Hiring Manager,\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Intern  position at Digi Coders , With currently Pursing Bachelor of Engineering in Information Technology from the Oriental Institute of Science and Technology and hands-on experience as a Java Full Stack\r\nDeveloper, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your team.\r\nIn my current role as an Intern at Wipro Talent Next, I have honed my skills in developing scalable web applications using Java\r\nEE and Spring Boot. Collaborating with a dynamic team, I have actively participated in code reviews and contributed to best\r\npracticesfor code quality, performance optimization, and maintainability. My experience at Oasis InfoByte as a Project Intern\r\nfurther solidified my expertise in developing and deploying web-based projects using Java EE, Spring Boot, and MySQL. I\r\nhave successfully integrated back-end services with responsive front-end interfaces, ensuring seamless user experiences.\r\nThroughout my academic and professional journey, I have consistently demonstrated a strong aptitude for problem-solving\r\nand a keen interest in staying updated with the latest industry trends and technologies. My technical skills include Java, DSA,\r\nOOP, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Spring, Spring Boot, Bootstrap, Git, MySQL, and AWS. Additionally, I have led the development\r\nof several projects, including a comprehensive e-commerce application, a real-time chat application, and a visualization tool\r\nfor sorting algorithms.\r\nMy dedication to continuous learning and skill development is evidenced by my certifications in IBM Cloud, AWS, Java, Data\r\nStructures in Java, and Computer Networking (CCNA) from reputable institutions such as CISCO and Skill soft.\r\nI am confident that my technical proficiency, coupled with my strong problem-solving skills and ability to work collaboratively, make me a valuable asset to your team. I am enthusiastic about the opportunity to leverage my expertise to contribute to the innovative projects at Digi Coders.\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how my background, skills, and\r\ncertifications align with the needs of your team. Please feel free to contact me at your earliest convenience to schedule an\r\ninterview.\r\nYours Faithfully\r\nHimanshu Sahu\r\n(+91)-9125227292\r\nhimanshusahu2301@gmail.com', 'true', '2024-07-31', '02:05:23PM'),
