(504, 'Ayush Tiwari', 'at659242@gmail.com', '8318852876', 'Any Other', '4fe6a9137826dc9edb32d63559c10873_resume.pdf', 'I hope you are doing well. I am interested in the position at Digi Coder for the Software developer Role I found on your career page. I have 4 months of experience in Oracle Technology such as Oracle Forms, Oracle Reports, SQL, PL/SQL, Oracle Fusion Middleware, Weblogic, Toad, D2K, Oracle DBA  and as well as 8 months of experience in frontend technology such as HTML5, CSS3, BOOTSTRAP, WORDPRESS, JQUERY, PHP. I can contribute effectively to your team and my skills as a Software Developer match the role\'s requirements.\r\n\r\nThank you for taking precious time from your busy schedule and considering my application.\r\n\r\nFor convenience, I have attached my resume with this email for your better understanding of my background. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss my abilities and skills as they make me a strong candidate for this position.\r\n', 'true', '2024-08-06', '05:00:23PM'),
