(509, 'Ansil Rahman', 'ansilrahman777@gmail.com', '8592959403', 'Any Other', '6e8e59dd4f94a77f871873d4816cdb9a_resume.pdf', 'Certainly! Here’s a concise cover letter-style description for a job application form:\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nAs a dedicated Python Full Stack Development student at Brototype Academy, I am honing my skills in developing dynamic web applications using Django and React.js. Through my hands-on project work, I have gained practical experience in both frontend and backend technologies, and I am eager to contribute my expertise to drive organizational success.', 'true', '2024-08-07', '07:00:24PM'),
