(511, 'Brijesh Singh', 'brskumar0102@gmail.com', '7237039667', 'Any Other', 'a964f7ece0587e9385ffe0ef28d75bb4_resume.pdf', 'Dear Sir/Madam,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well. My name is Brijesh Singh, and I am a final-year student of B.tech at Madan Mohan Malaviya University of Technology, Gorakhpur, pursuing a degree in Computer Science and Engineering . I am writing to express my keen interest in the Full Stack Developer position at Digicoders.\r\n\r\nWith a strong passion for software development, I have cultivated a solid foundation in both frontend and backend technologies. My experience includes proficiency in C++, Python, and JavaScript, among other tools and frameworks essential for full-stack development.\r\n\r\nI have attached my resume for your review, which provides a more detailed overview of my skills, experiences, and qualifications. I am eager to contribute to the innovative projects at Digicoders and further develop my expertise within your esteemed company.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nBrijesh Singh\r\nMobile: 7237039667\r\nLinkedIn- https://www.linkedin.com/in/brijesh-singh-456185228/', 'true', '2024-08-09', '07:59:21PM'),
