(523, 'Sandeep Kumar Patel', 'sundeepaarya5094@gmail.com', '9695114515', 'Any Other', 'dd0a87b6bdbbdb6e5c087b6489ffc7fc_resume.pdf', 'Hello Sir,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\n\r\nI am excited to submit my application for the Web Developer position at Digicoders. With a strong background in front-end and back-end development, combined with a passion for creating dynamic and user-friendly web experiences, I am eager to contribute to your team.What excites me about Digicoders is your commitment to innovation and user-centric design. I am confident that my technical skills, along with my proactive problem-solving abilities and enthusiasm for continuous learning, make me a strong fit for this role.Attached is my resume for your review. I would be thrilled to discuss how my background and skills align with the needs of your team. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to speak with you.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nSandeep Kumar Patel\r\n', 'true', '2024-08-12', '03:56:18PM'),
