(529, 'Akash Gupta', 'rr4408@gmail.com', '7905572486', 'Any Other', 'f422249c33ab646bb3f152f95c3e650f_resume.pdf', 'As a recent graduate with a solid foundation in both web development and data analytics, I am eager to apply my skills in a professional setting. My academic projects have equipped me with hands-on experience in building websites using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and working with data through Python, SQL, and data visualization tools. Although I am at the start of my career, my passion for technology and problem-solving, combined with my willingness to learn and adapt, make me confident in my ability to contribute effectively to any team. I am excited to bring fresh ideas and a strong work ethic to a dynamic role in web development or data analytics.', 'true', '2024-08-15', '02:48:26PM'),
