(531, 'Shambhavi Gupta', 'shambhavi05gupta@gmail.com', '8574780205', 'Any Other', '0b11a8521d7488f66c6bffb7e7571bf3_resume.pdf', ' I am writing to express my interest in exploring full-time opportunities in technical roles at DigiCoders. I have recently completed my graduation and have been honing my skills in front-end development through various projects and internships. I am particularly skilled in technologies like React, React Native, Node JS, and TailwindCSS.\r\n\r\nAttached is my resume for your consideration. I would be grateful if you could inform me of any current or upcoming openings that align with my background and skills.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I am eager to contribute to your team and grow. I look forward to discussing any opportunities in more detail.', 'true', '2024-08-15', '11:49:48PM'),
(532, 'Sparsh Kapoor', 'sparshkapoor0401@gmail.com', '9005569023', 'Any Other', 'c701415d597900d50a9bb6e8bcdcbf6b_resume.pdf', ' Subject: Application for Fresher’s Software Developer Position\r\n\r\nDear Sir,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well. My name is Sparsh Kapoor, and I am writing to express my interest in the Fresher’s Software Developer position at Digi Coders, applying on website for a fresher’s.\r\n\r\nI recently graduated with a B.Tech Degree in ECE from Amrita University, Bangalore, where I developed a strong foundation in software development through coursework and hands-on projects. My academic experience has equipped me with proficiency in programming languages such as [Python, C++], as well as familiarity with software development methodologies, data structures, and algorithms.\r\n\r\nDuring my studies, I completed some projects. These experiences allowed me to refine my problem-solving skills and gain practical knowledge of the software development lifecycle.\r\n\r\n I am eager to contribute to your team and am confident that my enthusiasm and willingness to learn will make me a valuable asset to Digi Coders.\r\n\r\nAttached to this email is my resume, which provides additional details about my education and experience. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background and skills align with the needs of your team. Thank you for considering my application.\r\n\r\nI look forward to the possibility of contributing to Digi Coders and am available at your convenience for an interview. Please feel free to contact me at 9005569023 or via email at sparshkapoor0401@gmail.com\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nSparsh Kapoor\r\n', 'true', '2024-08-16', '04:52:04PM'),
(533, 'Aftab Alam', 'aftabkld567@gmail.com', '8467035348', 'Any Other', '2e1d8d5dc9e6758f63516384bd4c72a5_resume.pdf', 'Dear hiring team,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in MERN Developer position intern advertised. With good experience in MERN development and a strong proficiency in related technologies, I am eager to contribute to your team. Please find my resume attached.', 'true', '2024-08-16', '08:09:05PM'),
