(535, 'Kaushal Jha', 'rajveernarayan9041@gmail.com', '9041484103', 'Any Other', '494451736c4f758d21384acee7c129ca_resume.pdf', 'Dear Sir/Ma\'am,\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Technical Writer position at DigiCoders. With four years of experience in both technical and SEO-focused content, I have developed strong skills in creating clear, concise, and engaging documentation. My background includes producing user manuals, API documentation, and content optimized for search engines. I am eager to bring my expertise to your team and contribute to DigiCoders’s success.\r\n\r\nKindly check my Resume for more details.\r\n\r\nI look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my experience aligns with your needs.\r\n\r\nRegards \r\nKaushal Jha\r\n', 'true', '2024-08-19', '09:39:56PM'),
