(570, 'Srishti Singh', 'thakursrish2000@gmail.com', '9670400601', 'Any Other', '7608a5963a9ca3521c677ce8402ccdd2_resume.pdf', 'I\'m a quick learner and adaptive individual, who is looking for an opportunity to give her best in the growth of company and herself too.\r\nI have been working as a Web Developer since more than a year specialised in frontend and backend development using Angular JS, Node Js, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, bootstrap, MongoDB and framework like Django.\r\nI\'m looking forward to join a team where I can learn and grow and give my best in the growth of the firm simultaneously \r\n\r\nPlease let me know if we can have a conversation over this, would love to hear from you.\r\n', 'true', '2024-08-28', '07:56:26PM'),
