(573, 'Danish Anjum', 'danjum160@gmail.com', '07904295039', 'Any Other', '9222e6d0b72b0269427d520b8818def0_resume.pdf', 'With my background in .NET development, including experience with C#, .NET Core, and leading successful projects, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team. I am particularly interested in expanding my skills in Angular and working on innovative projects. To excel in this role, access to resources for continued learning and opportunities for mentorship would be greatly appreciated. I am eager to leverage my expertise and grow within your organization.', 'true', '2024-08-28', '11:12:55PM'),
