(575, 'Manish Yadav', 'manishyadav552001@gmail.com', '09580699275', 'Any Other', '5d8a5977f38700ac83baffb515c9906b_resume.pdf', 'Greeting ,\r\n\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well. My name is Manish Yadav, and I recently graduated with a B.Tech in Computer Science. I came across your profile and was truly impressed by your experience at your Company.\r\n\r\nI’m reaching out to see if there might be any opportunities for a Java Developer at your company. I have strong experience with Java, Spring Boot, Hibernate, and other related technologies, and I’m very eager to contribute my skills to a team like yours.\r\n\r\nIf there aren’t any current openings, I would be incredibly grateful if you could consider me for future opportunities or keep me in mind when the hiring process begins again. Any advice or guidance you can offer would also be greatly appreciated.\r\n\r\nThank you so much for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nManish Yadav', 'true', '2024-08-29', '04:18:22AM'),
(576, 'Yash raj Shukla', 'yaash.shukla@gmail.com', '06386208909', 'Any Other', '15d1e4d17f93577f31e09e56e5f2969d_resume.pdf', 'Yash Raj Shukla\r\nyaash.shukla@gmail.com | 6386208909 \r\nLucknow, India \r\nLinkedIn - (https://www.linkedin.com/in/yash-raj-shukla) \r\nGitHub - (https://github.com/YaashRajShukla)\r\nDear Sir/Ma’am,\r\nI am excited to express my interest in a Job opportunity with your esteemed organization.\r\nWith a Bachelor of Technology in Artificial Intelligence from BBD University and hands-on experience in web development\r\nand data analytics, I am confident in my ability to make a meaningful contribution to your team.\r\nAs a Web Development Intern at Bharat Intern, I gained significant experience developing interactive and responsive web \r\napplications using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. I designed user-friendly interfaces that enhanced user experiences and \r\nensured seamless interaction across various browsers and devices. This role sharpened my skills in front-end development \r\nand user experience design, making me a strong fit for your requirements.\r\nIn my role as a Data Analyst at Med Tour Easy, I delved into age distribution data to analyze the differences in average age \r\nbetween left-handed and right-handed individuals. This project demanded precise data analysis, problem-solving skills, and \r\na thorough understanding of machine learning algorithms and deep learning techniques. My proficiency in Python and data \r\nanalytics, developed during this internship, equips me well for roles requiring detailed data interpretation and application.\r\nBeyond my professional experience, I have undertaken several projects that highlight my technical skills and creativity. I \r\ncreated a personal portfolio website using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to showcase my projects, skills, and accomplishments. \r\nAdditionally, I developed a Netflix clone, demonstrating my capability to replicate complex interfaces, and a responsive \r\nlogin/signup page, showcasing my commitment to cross-device compatibility.\r\nMy commitment to continuous learning is evidenced by my certifications from Accenture in Artificial Intelligence and Great \r\nLearning in Python Basic Programs. These certifications have deepened my knowledge of AI and programming, preparing me \r\nto tackle challenges effectively.\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my background, skills, and \r\ncertifications can contribute to your team’s success. Please feel free to contact me at yaash.shukla@gmail.com or \r\n6386208909 to schedule an interview.\r\nSincerely,\r\nYash Raj Shukla\r\nEnclosures:\r\n- Resume - (https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DrWx9OsnAI8FEiZ71HpHVR02C9VdbvsX/view?usp=sharing)\r\n- Portfolio Website - (https://yaashrajshukla.github.io/Responsive-Portfolio-Website/)', 'true', '2024-08-29', '09:02:29AM'),
(577, 'Pankaj Kumar Nishad', 'pankajofficial@gmail.com', '9793964736', 'Any Other', '420ee78ac04e61a9b412937b3990257b_resume.pdf', 'I hope you doing well\r\nI am applying for Java software developer position as advertised on your company’s site recently. My Educational Qualifications and 3+ years’ experience in java developer are ideal match for job requirements.\r\n\r\n I believe that my problem solving, team work, coding skills abilities can make an immediate and effective contribution to your company.\r\n To demonstrate the scope of my career history and professional competencies, kindly find the attached resume for reference.\r\n\r\n My Skills: core Java,Java8, J2ee, Spring Boot, Hibernate, Microservices, Webservices, Mvc, MySQL, Mongodb, Angular, Eclipse, Sts Tag, Postman Tools Etc.,\r\n\r\n Please find my attached resume for more details. For reference\r\n\r\n1. Total Work Experience *: 3+ years\r\n\r\n2. Relevant Years of Exp *: 3+ years\r\n\r\n3. Current CTC *: -4.43 LPA\r\n\r\n4. Expected CTC *: - 8(negotiable)\r\n\r\n5. Notice Period: - immediate joiner (18 April LWD) \r\n\r\n6. Current Company*: - PNB MetLife \r\n\r\n7. Preferred Location*: - PAN INDIA\r\n\r\n8. Ready to relocate(Y/N): -YES\r\n\r\n I appreciate your evolution of my credentials and subsequent response.\r\n\r\nThanks & Regards\r\nPankaj Kumar Nishad \r\nMobile NO: - 9793964736', 'true', '2024-08-29', '01:41:03PM'),
