(579, 'Rudal Kumar', 'krudal904@gmail.com', '8083607917', 'Any Other', 'aedc6eeaa4e22468b84e5f6704f4c8a3_resume.pdf', '\"Over the past year, I have gained solid experience as a PHP developer, honing my skills in backend development, database management, and integrating PHP with front-end technologies. I have successfully contributed to various projects, ensuring efficient, secure, and scalable solutions. My experience has deepened my understanding of core PHP concepts, object-oriented programming preparing me for more complex challenges ahead.\"', 'true', '2024-08-30', '12:12:00PM'),
