(581, 'Akshay Mathur', 'akshaymathur2003@gmail.com', '09956119499', 'Any Other', '4a861ca9fc05e8f0e2e563fb97e7cad0_resume.pdf', 'Here\'s a professional message you can use to reach out to the recruiter:\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Subject:** Application for Software Engineer (Fresher) Position\r\n\r\nDear [Recruiter\'s Name],\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well. I recently came across the Software Engineer (Fresher) position at [Company Name] and am excited to apply.\r\n\r\nI have recently completed my Bachelor of Technology in Information Technology, where I gained a strong foundation in both front-end and back-end development, working with languages such as Java and JavaScript. My experience includes a one-month internship where I was involved in the full software development life cycle, allowing me to enhance my skills in development frameworks and third-party libraries.\r\n\r\nI am particularly drawn to this opportunity because of [Company Name]\'s reputation for innovative and scalable software solutions. I am eager to contribute to your dynamic team, utilizing my technical skills and collaborative mindset. Additionally, I have a strong understanding of visual design and utility, and I am familiar with Agile methodologies, which I believe align well with the requirements of this role.\r\n\r\nI am looking forward to the possibility of discussing how my background, skills, and enthusiasm align with the needs of your team. Thank you for considering my application.\r\n\r\nBest regards,  \r\n', 'true', '2024-08-30', '09:42:16PM'),
(582, 'Akshay Mathur', 'akshaymathur2003@gmail.com', '9956119499', 'Any Other', '4cf761a1344db1bf0240cea469e07c23_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nMy name is Akshay Mathur, and I recently completed my Bachelor\'s of Technology in Information Technology. I am reaching out to inquire if there are any opportunities available for fresh graduates like myself.\r\n\r\nI have attached my resume for your consideration, and I would greatly appreciate the opportunity to discuss how I can be a valuable addition to company. I am open to any roles or internships that might be suitable for someone with my background.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nAkshay Mathur\r\nakshaymathur2003@gmail.com', 'true', '2024-08-30', '09:48:31PM'),
(583, 'Khushi Jaiswal', 'khushijaiswal977@gmail.com', '08981553819', 'Any Other', '2604f3983a997399e42332ff074f2a92_resume.pdf', 'I am writing to express my interest in the UI/Ux Designer position . As a recent graduate with a strong foundation in Designing, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute my skills in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Figma, Mockup, Wireframe, Prototypes to your team.\r\n\r\nMy proficiency in Figma, where I created mockups and wireframes that helped streamline the design process and enhance user experience. I already understand the essential tools and features in Figma and am eager to deepen my skills. I am quick to adapt, work well in teams, and communicate clearly. I am confident that I can bring fresh ideas and grow into a valuable member of your team.', 'true', '2024-08-31', '10:03:15AM'),
