(698, 'Kashifa Idreesi', 'idreesi.kashifa@gmail.com', '8840720331', 'Any Other', '7d90b8784dae1be6d0638dab2fac1bf7_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nI\'m thrilled to apply for the Digital Marketing position at your company. I bring a strong foundation in digital marketing strategies and a passion for driving business growth through innovative online solutions. With over a year of experience in digital marketing, I\'ve developed a solid expertise in creating and executing effective campaigns that drive engagement, conversions, and brand awareness.\r\n\r\nMy journey began at the Saroj Institute of Technology and Management, where I worked as a Digital Marketer and honed my skills in social media management, content creation, and analytics. Currently, I\'m working at Bito Technologies as a Digital Marketer and SEO Executive, where I\'ve expanded my skill set to include search engine optimization, pay-per-click advertising, and team collaboration.\r\n\r\nIn addition to my professional experience, I\'ve also enhanced my skills through further education. I hold a Post-Graduation Diploma Certificate in Digital Marketing from IIT Roorkee, completed through the online platform Intellipaat. Furthermore, I\'ve earned a Digital Marketing Certificate from safalta.com, demonstrating my commitment to staying up-to-date with industry trends and best practices.\r\n\r\nI\'m proud of the results I\'ve achieved so far, and I\'m eager to leverage my expertise to drive success in this new role. I\'m excited about the opportunity to join your company and contribute my skills and experience to help drive business growth and success.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I\'m looking forward to talking more about my qualifications.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nKashifa Idreesi', 'true', '2024-10-14', '11:16:20AM'),
(699, 'Akchhaya Kumar Soni ', 'akchhayasoni08@gmail.com', '8090662034', 'Any Other', '7f5e14c6f09d20b48ab064f7347e05b4_resume.pdf', 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nWarm Greetings,\r\n\r\nMy name is \'Akchhaya\' and I am looking for a job.\r\n\r\nWith a knack of Business analyst and Support team lead I hold 6 years of experience with ecommerce domain and various frameworks like Shopify, Bigcommerce, Woocommerce and lil bit of Magento.\r\n\r\nI used to manage the product support team to deliver exceptional support to the users and making their online selling experience better. I have also deal with requirement gathering and management with cross team collaboration.\r\n\r\nI believe i would be an asset to your team with my experience and skills of requirement gathering and management and product development.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to hearing from you\r\n\r\nThanks and Regards,\r\nAkchhaya Soni', 'true', '2024-10-14', '05:03:53PM'),
