(714, 'Ashish Kumar Prajapati', 'akpprajapati11@gmail.com', '8107438239', 'Any Other', '7bab40a750fb39015e71df263bd48ca3_resume.pdf', 'I am a fresher, Recently completed my Bachelors of Technology in Computer Science and engineering with aggregate CGPA of 8.4. I done internships in Front-End web development with technologies HTML, CSS, JavaScript and ReactJS. And internship with android application development using Flutter, Dart.', 'true', '2024-10-21', '10:48:14AM'),
