(717, 'Chandan', 'cpandit54@gmail.com', '9582066505', 'Any Other', '0f732df13c2845f214d65a5a449f10f1_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in opportunities within your esteemed organisation, where I can leverage my extensive experience as a Scrum Master and QA Lead. With over 8 years in the IT industry, I have honed my skills in Quality Assurance, Project Management, and Agile methodologies, consistently driving improvements in product quality and operational efficiency.\r\n\r\nIn my current role at HCLTech India Pvt. Ltd, I lead cross-functional teams, implementing agile best practices to enhance project delivery and stakeholder satisfaction. My expertise in various testing methodologies, coupled with my proficiency in tools like JIRA and Quality Center, has enabled me to deliver defect-free products while mentoring team members to foster a culture of continuous improvement.\r\n\r\nI am particularly proud of my achievements, including a 30% increase in project efficiency and a significant reduction in delivery times through effective process streamlining. My ability to translate customer requirements into actionable user stories has been instrumental in ensuring alignment between business needs and project outcomes.\r\n\r\nI am excited about the possibility of contributing to your team and am confident that my background and skills will be a valuable asset. Thank you for considering my application.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\nChandan Chaturvedi\r\n\r\nEnclosed: Resume\r\n\r\n', 'true', '2024-10-21', '01:35:49PM'),
(718, 'Karan Raj Srivastava', 'me.karan19@outlook.com', '7887228894', 'Any Other', 'f4b17bfd6f4bb926a3e5cc9d2ed09f16_resume.pdf', 'Hi, \r\n\r\nGreetings for the day!\r\n\r\nI\'m a QA Engineer, with 3+ years of experience in Quality Assurance which mainly consists of End-to-end manual testing, Automation Testing, API Testing, Mobile Testing, Web Testing. \r\nI\'m currently working with a service-based company and looking for a switch. I\'m willing to apply for the QA role. Attaching my resume and looking for your positive reciprocation so that we can discuss this further.\r\n\r\nWarm Regards, \r\nKaran Raj Srivastava', 'true', '2024-10-21', '08:41:36PM'),
(719, 'Alankrat Singh', 'singhyugansh@gmail.com', '7985543801', 'Any Other', '8cfa80a37fecd9da127764b5c70b4692_resume.pdf', 'Hello,\r\nI am Alankrat Singh from Kanpur. I am seeking an opportunity in web development field if you have any openings then please revert back to me.\r\nThank You ', 'true', '2024-10-22', '09:43:21AM'),
