(727, 'Roshan Kumar', 'roshan02code@gmail.com', '07484014316', 'Any Other', '9d226ee125558048057564820d64309c_resume.pdf', 'I\'m looking for the Software Developer position at your company. I have successfully built and deployed scalable web applications, designed RESTful APIs, and collaborated with cross-functional teams to deliver robust software solutions.\r\n\r\nCurrently I am working as Associate Solution Leader(SDE-1) in Brane Enterprises .\r\nI am a recent graduate from IIIT Ranchi ,with a strong focus on Backend Development and Data Structures and Algorithms. I am eager to further my career as a software Engineer.\r\n\r\nMy resume ,which is linked above, offers a concise overview of my technical experience, academic background and key projects. I believe my skills and dedication would make me a strong fit for this position.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to hearing more about the role. Please let me know if you need any additional information.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nRoshan Kumar', 'true', '2024-10-25', '01:56:13PM'),
(728, 'Kaustubh chandel', 'kaustubhchandel58@gmail.com', '9506369162', 'Any Other', '5dae1a13468610141de4888ef67483d0_resume.pdf', 'As a Team Lead in full-stack development, I spearhead the department and lead projects using the MERN stack. My role involves developing robust backend systems with Node.js and MongoDB and crafting intuitive frontend applications with React Native. I guide a team of developers, ensuring project success from concept to deployment. My responsibilities include strategic planning, project management, and hands-on coding, delivering high-quality, efficient solutions across all stages of development.Delivering 3 websites, 2 in wordpress, 1 in react and 2 application 1 completed upto Google playstore internal testing to production testing stage and 1 released.', 'true', '2024-10-26', '11:19:27AM'),
(729, 'Manish yadav', 'par642662@gmail.com', '9517642662', 'Any Other', '50b3c432278ea8c1d4ad7567e539ad5b_resume.pdf', 'As a dedicated and accomplished Computer Science graduate of 2024 from R.R. Institute of Modern Technology, I bring a strong foundation in programming languages, particularly Python, and expertise in web development, data analysis, and machine learning. My academic achievements are complemented by hands-on experience in projects such as car price prediction and Indian districts safety predictor, demonstrating my advanced technical skills.\r\nI have also completed impactful internships in web development and data analysis, showcasing my proficiency in tools like Excel, Power BI, and AWS. With a comprehensive background in computer science and a passion for innovation, I am confident in my ability to make a valuable contribution to the tech industry.', 'true', '2024-10-27', '11:13:09PM'),
