(748, 'Manav Gupta', 'manavgupta16000@gmail.com', '7570046620', 'Any Other', '82ad74eab296bbacc02b3d311b2dc27d_resume.pdf', 'I am excited to apply for the DigiCoders, where I can leverage my skills in technology to contribute to innovative projects. With a background in Computer Applications, I am passionate about using technology to solve real-world problems and enhance user experiences. I admire DigiCoder\'s commitment to embrace tech and provide complex solutions with ease, and I am eager to be part of a team that drives impactful change in the tech industry.', 'true', '2024-11-07', '02:15:41AM'),
(749, 'ashok kumar rawat', 'ashok10aug1994@gmail.com', '8299008014', 'Any Other', '6d45062814fca8f8526c588a7c81b187_resume.docx', 'I am reaching out to express my interest in any open positions at DigiCoders. With a strong background in full-stack development and a solid foundation in IT, complemented by my diploma in Information Technology from Government Polytechnic, Lucknow, I am confident in my ability to contribute to your team. My skills include hands-on experience with Laravel, React, Next.js, Tailwind CSS, and both frontend and backend development, making me well-suited to tackle a variety of technical challenges.', 'true', '2024-11-07', '01:36:02PM'),
