(758, 'Suman Kumar', 'iamsuman.0699@gmail.com', '9507036595', 'Any Other', '1b544d2b6cf504424726ad8a92f7b2aa_resume.pdf', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Fullstack Engineer at  Digicoder. With over three years of experience as a Software Engineer at Tech Mahindra, I have honed my skills in Java, Spring Boot, and frontend technologies like React.js. I am eager to contribute my expertise in managing Java applications, optimizing SQL databases, and enhancing user experience through strategic software development initiatives.\r\n\r\nAt Tech Mahindra, I have had the opportunity to work on diverse projects, including managing Java solutions for Ford CLOC and enhancing user interfaces for AT&T. My experience in integrating React.js components and managing databases has consistently improved platform usability and performance, resulting in a 30% increase in user retention rates and a 20% boost in customer satisfaction. My hands-on experience with GCP, Terraform, and various development tools like Git and Gradle has further strengthened my ability to deliver robust and scalable solutions.\r\n\r\nI am confident that my technical skills, combined with my proactive approach to problem-solving and passion for continuous learning, would make me a valuable asset to your team.\r\n\r\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my experience and skills align with the needs of your team. I am available at your earliest convenience for an interview and can be reached at +91 9507036595 or via email at iamsuman.0699@gmail.com.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nSuman Kumar', 'true', '2024-11-12', '06:04:06PM'),
