(787, 'Syed Haider Mehdi', 'haidersm@outlook.com', '9511114757', 'Any Other', '80f1486040501573edfea605241cca4d_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager ,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well. \r\n\r\nMy name is Haider Mehdi, and I am thrilled to express my interest in the Sales Head position in Lucknow. With over 19 years of extensive experience in IT software sales, I bring a proven track record of driving business growth, developing strategic sales plans, and fostering lasting client relationships.\r\n\r\nIn my current role as Regional Sales Head at Proftech and Criterion Tech, I have been instrumental in expanding market presence and identifying high-impact opportunities within my region. I specialize in crafting and executing sales strategies aligned with organizational goals, consistently delivering results that strengthen market share and establish long-term growth.\r\n\r\nMy deep understanding of Criterion Tech’s innovative product suite—including the Patient Monitoring Dashboard, Digital Therapeutics solutions, Learning Management System, Hospital Information Management System, HRMS, and other cutting-edge technologies—enables me to effectively communicate their value to clients, addressing their specific needs and solidifying our reputation as a trusted industry partner.\r\n\r\nBuilding meaningful and enduring relationships with key stakeholders, is a cornerstone of my approach. By understanding client requirements deeply, I deliver tailored solutions that exceed expectations. Furthermore, my proactive stance on analyzing industry trends and competitor activities ensures we stay ahead of the curve, continually refining strategies to maintain our competitive edge.\r\n\r\nI am especially excited about this opportunity as I am eager to relocate to Lucknow, my hometown. Having worked in major cities, I have gained valuable experience, business ethics, and professionalism, which I believe will allow me to contribute even more effectively in a familiar environment. I am confident that my understanding of the local market combined with my professional expertise will enable me to drive exceptional results and add significant value to your organization.\r\n\r\nI am enthusiastic about bringing my skills and experience to your esteemed organization and contributing to its continued success. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my background aligns with your vision and goals.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I would be delighted to provide further details or discuss my qualifications in an interview.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nHaider Mehdi\r\n+91-9511114757\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/syedhaidermehdi/', 'true', '2024-12-01', '01:21:51PM'),
(788, 'Aftab Alam ', 'aftabkld567@gmail.com', '8467035348', 'Any Other', 'ea4073667720c5f1e34bc4d777b6c30f_resume.pdf', 'Dear hiring team,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in MERN Developer position intern advertised. With good experience in MERN development and a strong proficiency in related technologies, I am eager to contribute to your team. Please find my resume attached.', 'true', '2024-12-02', '12:25:00PM'),
