(803, 'Purnima Singh ', 'purnimasingh942@gmail.com', '7007609081', 'Any Other', 'f419a1efb3ec9e34d4bc002f2f88a3cc_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Data Analyst/SQL Developer role. As a recent B.Tech graduate in Computer Science, I have developed strong technical skills in SQL, Python, and Excel, which I am eager to apply in a professional environment.\r\n\r\nI have worked on projects like \"Face Recognition with Automatic Attendance\", utilizing Python and Excel for data management, and an e-commerce project where I used SQL to optimize business operations. Earning an Advanced SQL Certificate from HackerRank further solidified my database expertise.\r\n\r\nI am passionate about analyzing data, uncovering insights, and supporting data-driven decision-making. My ability to adapt quickly and approach challenges analytically makes me confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I would be happy to discuss how my skills align with the requirements of the role. I look forward to the opportunity for an interview.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nPurnima Singh\r\nEmail: purnimasingh942@gmail.com\r\nPhone: 7007609081\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'true', '2024-12-09', '06:36:53PM'),
