(831, 'sonali singh', 'linasosingh@gmail.com', '09580758698', 'Any Other', 'a0186c5b71b28dc151a75a3fa60d88a7_resume.pdf', 'I hope this message finds you well. My name is Sonali Singh, and I am a passionate web designer with 1.5 years of experience in creating responsive, user-friendly websites using technologies like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, WordPress, and Bootstrap.\r\n\r\nI am reaching out to express my interest in joining Digi coders as a web designer. My expertise includes creating dynamic designs, optimizing websites for performance, and delivering visually appealing and functional user experiences.', 'true', '2024-12-21', '11:14:39AM'),
