(833, 'Smriti Vijay', 'smr17vijay@gmail.com', '8887846357', 'Any Other', '5a6beb5ad68b00e0d042aea772f8e6c5_resume.pdf', 'Dear HR,\r\nI am excited to apply for the HR position. As a recent graduate with a Masters degree in Human Resource Management from Institute of technology & management Gida Gorakhpur Affiliated to Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University Lucknow, I am eager to start my HR career with your esteemed company.\r\nDuring my studies, I gained practical experience through internship at Hindustan Urvarak and Rasayan Ltd (HURL) Gorakhpur, where I assisted with recruitment, employee relations, and training initiatives. These roles have honed my communication, organizational, and problem-solving skills.\r\nI am particularly drawn to Digicoders Technologies due to your commitment to fostering a positive workplace culture and emphasis on employee development. I am confident that my proactive approach and dedication to excellence will make me a valuable addition to your HR team.\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your organization\'s success.\r\nSincerely,\r\nSmriti Vijay.\r\n', 'true', '2024-12-22', '01:24:46PM'),
(834, 'Shashi Kant ', 'shashikantsln1793@gmail.com', '6394582014', 'Any Other', '23d6c8af4e2e8bb0e1d947358132ccce_resume.pdf', 'Hi,\r\nI came across digicoders recently and was really impressed with your company culture. As a budding web developer with a passion for building cool things, I was wondering if you might have any internship openings available.\r\nI\'ve got a solid foundation in front-end and some back-end technologies, including:\r\n * Front-end: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, ReactJS, Tailwind CSS, Bootstrap\r\n * Back-end: Node.js, Express.js\r\nI\'m also comfortable using Postman for API testing. I\'m eager to learn, contribute to a team, and gain some real-world experience.\r\nWould you be open to a quick chat to see if I might be a good fit for any current or upcoming internship opportunities?\r\nThanks for your time!', 'true', '2024-12-23', '09:31:28PM'),
(835, 'Aryan Srivastav', 'aryansky333@gmail.com', '8795526108', 'Any Other', 'f697cbe3e1dad11a7a65dfd91400724a_resume.pdf', 'I\'m a motivated IT individual with a professional experience in the industry. I have a great experience working on web designing and development which I can utilise to contribute to the growth of the company.', 'true', '2024-12-23', '09:37:02PM'),
(836, 'Pradyumn Srivastava', 'ankursrivastava905@gmail.com', '9838602705', 'Any Other', '1ddffd77c6f36f80026604a5d7f92ad8_resume.pdf', 'I hope this message finds you well. My name is Pradyumn Srivastava, and I am a .NET Backend Developer . I am currently working at Focus Management and Solutions and have had the opportunity to work onsite in Kenya, gaining valuable international exposure.I would welcome the opportunity to contribute to your team and bring value to your projects. Please find my attached resume for your consideration.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time.', 'true', '2024-12-23', '09:44:48PM'),
(837, 'Abu Osama Khan', 'khankhanosama19@gmail.com', '8172802284', 'Any Other', '2c21521ba28d5bd79e4257b6de3e1e7a_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Frontend Developer position. With one year of hands-on experience in React application development and a diverse skill set encompassing HTML, CSS, JavaScript, ES6, Bootstrap, Material UI-5 React, SQL, Tailwind Css, Redux, JSON, REST API, DOM Manipulation, JSW,  Git, and Shadcn UI, I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\r\n\r\nDuring my tenure, I successfully completed Multiple projects, honing my proficiency in translating UI/UX designs into fully functional and responsive web applications. My experience in integrating REST APIs and utilizing technologies such as Bootstrap and Material UI-5, React has enabled me to deliver user-friendly and visually appealing interfaces.\r\n\r\nI am available to join immediately. I am eager to bring my expertise and passion for frontend development and contribute to its success.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\nAbu Osama Khan \r\nFrontend Developer \r\n+91-8172802284\r\nAzamgarh', 'true', '2024-12-24', '02:40:25PM'),
(838, 'kunal srivastava', 'kunalmksrivasta@gmail.com', '8840338007', 'Any Other', '64f58825a2e112aa00d7eada8de5830f_resume.pdf', 'i\'m looking job marketing & opertion ', 'true', '2024-12-24', '03:23:32PM'),
(839, 'Aditya Nath Dubey ', 'ad334071@gmail.com', '7518290539', 'Any Other', '6964a64c8586e2d29e2b8c224792babb_resume.pdf', 'With 1 year and 3 months of professional experience in Node.js development, I have honed my skills in developing scalable backend solutions. \r\n\r\nDeveloped and maintained RESTful APIs, ensuring seamless integration with front-end applications.\r\n\r\nWorked with technologies like NodeJs Express.js, MongoDB\r\n', 'true', '2024-12-25', '10:54:17AM'),
