(860, 'Prabhanshu Kumar Gautam', 'prabhanshu.mca.1989@gmail.com', '8929751755', 'Any Other', '444078e0117f560b7eded8677be7d8e6_resume.pdf', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Front-End Developer role. With over 10 years of experience in React.js, Angular, JavaScript, and responsive design, I have a proven track record of building scalable, high-performance web applications.\r\n\r\nAt Preview Technologies, I led the development of Single Page Applications, optimized load times by 30%, and increased mobile user engagement by 25% through responsive design. My expertise in integrating REST APIs, optimizing state management, and leveraging cloud services ensures robust, user-centric solutions.\r\n\r\nI am excited about contributing to innovative projects. Please find my resume attached, and I would be happy to discuss how my skills align with your goals.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nPrabhanshu Kumar Gautam\r\nLucknow, UP, India\r\n+91-8929751755', 'true', '2025-01-04', '09:20:21PM'),
