(862, 'Aman kumar ', 'amankumarr0211@gmail.com', '7757829729', 'Any Other', '52e50e1ff5c4737d0902b1babf73bfd0_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\n I hope this message finds you well. I am writing to express my interest in the Web Developer position at your organization. With a Master’s in Computer Application and hands-on experience in ReactJS, Node.js, and Firebase, I am confident in my ability to contribute to your team.\r\n\r\nI have developed several dynamic applications, including an Airline Management System and a Contact Page App, which have enhanced my skills in building responsive websites. I would be thrilled to bring my skills in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and React to your organization and help drive the success of your web development projects. Please find my resume attached for further details on my qualifications and experience.\r\n\r\n    Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nAman Kumar\r\n+91 7757829729\r\namankumarr0211@gmail.com\r\nLinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/aman-kumar-9ab177212', 'true', '2025-01-07', '11:00:43AM'),
