(877, 'Mohd Asif Khan', 'asifkhan.ias786@gmail.com', '7860985539', 'Any Other', 'fccca33cc3b88bca8f08b5bce2f3cd67_resume.pdf', 'Hello good evening My name is Mohd Asif Khan, and I am a recent B-Tech graduate in Computer Science Engineering from Bansal Institute of Engineering & Technology, Lucknow. During my academic journey, I developed a strong foundation in Core Java, Advanced Java, and SQL, and I am excited to apply this knowledge in a professional environment.\r\nOne of my key projects was an Online Library Management System, where I designed a user-friendly interface using Java Swing and implemented robust database connectivity with SQL. This project helped me enhance my problem-solving and coding skills, as well as gain practical exposure to real-world development.\r\nI am passionate about learning and improving as a developer. I enjoy exploring new technologies and frameworks, such as Hibernate and Spring, and I have hands-on experience with tools like Eclipse and IntelliJ IDEA.\r\n\r\nMy strengths include a solid understanding of object-oriented programming, strong analytical skills, and the ability to work effectively in a team. I am eager to contribute to your organization’s success while developing my technical and professional skills as a Java Developer Trainee.\r\nThank you for the opportunity to introduce myself, and I look forward to contributing to your team.', 'true', '2025-01-09', '11:39:05PM'),
