(881, 'Kunwar Hitesh Singh', 'singhhitesh001122@gmail.com', '9792764689', 'Any Other', 'af6aac9fd1ec4363ac1c66df0bb5ed97_resume.pdf', 'My name is Kunwar Hitesh Singh, and I am excited to apply for the Laravel Developer position at your esteemed organization. I have attached my resume for your review.\r\n\r\nWith 2 years of professional experience in Laravel development, I have honed my skills in building robust, scalable, and secure web applications. During this time, I have worked on diverse projects, from designing RESTful APIs to implementing complex business logic and integrating third-party services. My expertise includes a deep understanding of Laravel\'s ecosystem, database optimization, and adhering to best coding practices.\r\n\r\nAfter carefully going through the job description, I am confident that my skills and experience align perfectly with the requirements of this role. My resume provides detailed insights into my previous projects, achievements, and current role.\r\n\r\nI am eager to contribute to your team and help drive innovative solutions. Thank you for considering my application. I would be delighted to discuss my qualifications further at your convenience.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to the opportunity to connect with you.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nKunwar Hitesh Singh', 'true', '2025-01-11', '02:18:31PM'),
