(883, 'Nandini', 'Snaptgirlnishad02@gmail.com', '8299818807', 'Any Other', '025d9c5eb624e4bb3f1a10d97c9fc917_resume.pdf', 'I am Nandini a  UX/UI designer based in India. I specializes in creating intuitive and user-friendly interfaces using tools like Figma, Adobe XD, and Canva. my expertise lies in understanding the user\'s needs and designing solutions that are simple, beautiful and effective. My pays close attention to details, visual hierarchy, accessibility and responsiveness in her work. i  convey complex ideas simply through visuals and interactions, allowing users to achieve their goals with minimal effort.  here my Portfolio Link (https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zVcscfj3AOO0rVwWpnbRcYlR7Z_AeFOB/view?usp=sharing) ', 'true', '2025-01-14', '06:18:19AM'),
(884, 'Arun sharma', 'arunsharma026@gmail.com', '7379720520', 'Any Other', '9f0b8a4cbb86ea60b693aa720fdeeac4_resume.pdf', 'Dear  HR,\r\n\r\nI am excited to apply for a position within your organization. At Hashtag Labs Pvt. Ltd., I gained over 9 years of experience in frontend development and UI/UX design. My expertise includes React.js, React Native, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Bootstrap, coupled with a proven ability to deliver impactful solutions.\r\n\r\nHighlights of my qualifications include:\r\n\r\nFrontend Development Expertise: Led the design and development of projects like the DMS for the Reserve Bank of Zimbabwe and the Flag Quiz Mobile App.\r\n\r\nUI/UX Design Skills: Figma, Photoshop, Illustrator\r\n\r\nProject Leadership: Successfully handled end-to-end development for various applications, including live cricket match statistics and quiz websites.\r\n\r\nI am eager to bring my technical skills and problem-solving abilities to your team to contribute meaningfully to your organization\'s success. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss my experience and how it aligns with your needs.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application.', 'true', '2025-01-15', '11:14:54AM'),
