(932, 'Ashveen verma', 'ashveen002@gmail.com', '07050406853', 'Any Other', 'af8e95a1a7d887191406cc3c79c71120_resume.pdf', 'Highly motivated Data Analyst and Junior Data Scientist with a proven track record of delivering outstanding results. Skilled in data visualizationusing Python (Pandas, NumPy, Matplotlib, Seaborn, Scikit-Learn), SQL, Tableau, and Power BI. Experienced in developing and implementing datamodels to analyze business improvements and using machine learning to provide valuable insights. Strong problem-solving skills, data-drivendecision-making, and effective communication. Currently a Junior Data Scientist at Dasceq India Pvt Ltd, focused on leveraging data for businessinsights. Passionate about performance marketing, digital acquisition, and data platforms, and committed to excelling in data science and analytics.', 'true', '2025-02-08', '07:04:35PM'),
