(937, 'Akarsh Maurya', 'akarshmaurya901@gmail.com', '8115809975', 'Any Other', '1066c33a7a2b98db06ca2c016811c5cf_resume.pdf', 'Respected Sir/Ma\'am \r\nMy name is Akarsh Maurya, and I am writing to express my interest in joining your esteemed IT company as a fresher. I have recently completed my Bachelor Degree and am eager to apply my knowledge in a real-world setting.\r\n\r\nAlthough I am new to the industry, I am passionate about IT and excited about the opportunity to grow professionally with a dynamic team like yours. I am ready and willing to relocate to Lucknow to pursue this opportunity and contribute effectively to your projects.', 'true', '2025-02-11', '04:45:56PM'),
