(939, 'Anant Pandey', 'pandeyanant363@gmail.com', '9369260948', 'Any Other', '12296f55c6af81a0a9dc075ab08f7ef4_resume.pdf', 'I am excited to apply for the Software Developer role. With expertise in React, Node.js, Express, and MongoDB, I have built and deployed scalable web applications, focusing on optimized user interfaces and robust backend architectures. My experience includes developing full-stack projects with real-time features, authentication, and cloud deployment.\r\n\r\nI look forward to the opportunity to contribute my skills and passion to a dynamic team. Thank you for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nAnant Pandey', 'true', '2025-02-11', '10:15:22PM'),
