(949, 'Talib Usmani', 'talibusmani0403@gmail.com', '7705084226', 'Any Other', 'f65582aac6bde920655c5025f963241d_resume.pdf', 'Subject: Job Application for Software Developer\r\nDear Hiring Manager,\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Website Developer position at your organization. As a final-year Computer Science Engineering student, I possess a strong foundation in web development, coupled with practical experience in building innovative and scalable solutions. \r\nMy expertise spans full-stack development, where I have worked extensively on front-end technologies like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, ReactJS, Bootstrap, and TailwindCSS, and back-end frameworks such as NodeJS and ExpressJS. Additionally, I am proficient in database management using MySQL and MongoDB and have a solid understanding of tools like Git, GitHub, and REST APIs to ensure seamless development workflows.\r\nI look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team and helping organization to achieve its vision. \r\nSincerely, \r\nTalib Usmani ', 'true', '2025-02-15', '12:13:51AM'),
