(954, 'Udit Narayan Saxena', 'udit9407@gmail.com', '7505266931', 'Any Other', '4f1393ad2807f6086d77b99c50b57b88_resume.pdf', 'Dear Sir,\r\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to express my interest in the Front end Developer position. With 1 years of experience in Web development through Projects in college , I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team and believe my skills in Web Development align well with the requirements of the role.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I have attached my resume for your review. I would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background, skills, and passion for Web Development make me a strong candidate for this position.\r\n\r\nI look forward to hearing from you soon.\r\nBest regard\r\n\r\nUdit Narayan Saxena\r\n7505266931\r\n', 'true', '2025-02-19', '10:45:48AM'),
