(957, 'Sandeep kumar Singh', 'sandeepkumarsingh221011@gmail.com', '08572998203', 'Any Other', '688b571441e92d5832ae1577bdd8fc68_resume.pdf', 'Dear Sir/Ma\'am,\r\n\r\nI hope this email finds you well. My name is Sandeep Kumar Singh, and\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Web Development\r\nat your company, as advertised on LinkedIn\r\n\r\nI am currently pursuing my B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering\r\nat Chandigarh University and have hands-on experience in web\r\ndevelopment. I recently interned at IIT BHU, where I contributed to\r\nthe development of web applications using technologies like React.js,\r\nNode.js, and JavaScript, focusing on user experience and performance\r\noptimization.\r\n\r\nSome of my notable projects include:\r\n\r\nBG Remover: A tool for image background removal with secure JWT-based\r\nauthentication.\r\nE-commerce Website: A comprehensive platform enabling users to buy and\r\nsell products, built with the MERN stack.\r\nTours & Travels Booking Website: A travel booking platform with\r\nintuitive UI/UX and seamless itinerary management.\r\n\r\nWith proficiency in modern web development frameworks, including the\r\nMERN stack, and strong problem-solving and collaboration skills, I am\r\nconfident in my ability to contribute effectively to your team.\r\n\r\nI have attached my resume for your review. I would be delighted to\r\ndiscuss how my skills and experiences align with the goals of our organization. Please feel free to contact me at (+91)\r\n8572998203 or via email at sandeepkumarsingh221011@gmail.com.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the\r\nopportunity to contribute to your Organization\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nSandeep Kumar Singh', 'true', '2025-02-21', '08:47:49AM'),
