(960, 'Yasir raza', 'yasir.cqa@gmail.com', '8920839821', 'Any Other', '49cdfb17347df7f8f96a8c0a1d1c3725_resume.pdf', 'I am actively seeking new opportunities in manual and automation testing, bringing 2 years of experience in ensuring software quality, performance, and reliability.\r\n\r\nMy expertise includes Selenium, Postman, JIRA, Eclipse, Java, Generative AI testing, Automation & Manual testing, TestRail, and Testim.io. I have hands-on experience in designing and executing test cases, identifying critical bugs, and ensuring seamless software functionality.\r\n\r\nI have attached my updated resume for your review. I would appreciate it if you could consider my profile for any relevant opportunities within your organization. Looking forward to your insights and the opportunity to discuss how my skills can contribute to your team.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.', 'true', '2025-02-23', '11:36:24PM'),
