(996, 'Tanveer Ansari', 'ansaritanveer994@gmail.com', '7054097424', 'Any Other', 'cd592febea9fbf2bb05e8741f7f8896f_resume.pdf', 'Dear sir/ma\'am,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Java Developer position at Future digicoders. With over 2 years of experience in developing scalable and efficient applications using Java, Hibernate, and Spring Boot, I am confident that I possess the skills and expertise required for this role.\r\n\r\nIn my current role at VGN IT Craftsmen Solutions Pvt. Ltd, I have gained extensive experience in:\r\n\r\n- Designing and developing enterprise-level applications using Java, Hibernate, and Spring Boot\r\n- Implementing database operations using Hibernate and SQL\r\n- Creating RESTful APIs using Spring Boot\r\n- Collaborating with cross-functional teams to identify and prioritize project requirements\r\n\r\nI am excited about the opportunity to join Future digicoders and contribute my skills and experience to the success of your team. I have attached my resume for your review.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to discussing my qualifications further.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nTanveer Anari\r\n', 'true', '2025-03-11', '02:48:03PM'),
