(999, 'Danish Anjum ', 'danjum170@gmail.com', '9479326051', 'Any Other', '05a88eb11d9036d28d84dd9b0ab0e067_resume.pdf', 'Hello,\r\n\r\nI am interested in applying for the Dotnet Full Stack Developer position at DigiCoders Technology private limited. I have 2.3 experience in .NET development, including C#, ASP.NET MVC/Core, SQL Server, and Web API. I would love the opportunity to contribute to your team. Please find my resume attached for your reference. Looking forward to your response.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nDanish Anjum', 'true', '2025-03-13', '12:19:30AM'),
