(1001, 'Himanshu Maurya', 'himanshumaurya018@gmail.com', '8299748597', 'Any Other', '7a3fe06717875f7d46adc5197102c683_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\nI am Himanshu Maurya, a recent graduate with a B.Tech in Computer Science Engineering. I am eager to begin my career as a Software Developer and am excited to apply my skills in software development, problem-solving, and programming languages such as Java, and web technologies.\r\n\r\nThroughout my academic journey, I have gained hands-on experience in coding, algorithm design, and working with databases. I have also participated in various projects and hackathons that helped me enhance my ability to work both independently and as part of a team. I am particularly passionate about building scalable, efficient, and user-friendly applications.\r\n\r\nI am looking for a challenging and dynamic environment where I can contribute to meaningful projects and further grow my technical expertise. I am confident that my enthusiasm, strong academic background, and willingness to learn make me a suitable candidate for this role.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills and interests align with your company\'s needs.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nHimanshu Maurya', 'true', '2025-03-14', '09:21:58AM'),
(1002, 'Abhishek Srivastav', 'abhisheksrivastav936@gmail.com', '9369843173', 'Any Other', '2b5d2fe4fa6d656f5ea987cb4b0ae1a2_resume.pdf', 'Hi DigiCoders Team,\r\n\r\nI have submitted my application through your careers portal. As a recent Computer Science graduate, I have worked on projects like a Real-Time Vehicle Tracking System Using Geofencing, where I implemented API integration, database management, and real-time tracking features.\r\n\r\nAs a fresher, I am eager to enter the tech field, apply my technical skills, and contribute effectively to your team. Looking forward to the opportunity!\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nAbhishek Srivastav.', 'true', '2025-03-14', '03:57:31PM'),
