(1004, 'Mohd aquib javed', 'nemesisgraphic19@gmail.com', '09044542535', 'Any Other', 'e37335f8865f91487fa7045c96701555_resume.pdf', '\r\nMohd Aquib bin Javed\r\nUI/UX Designer & Web Designer\r\nnemesisgraphic19@gmail.com\r\n+91 9044542535\r\nhttps://aquibdesigner.site/\r\n\r\n\r\nDear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in a UI/UX design role that leverages my expertise in creating engaging, user-centered digital experiences. With two years of experience in UI/UX and web design, I have consistently delivered creative and functional solutions that improve user engagement and drive business results.\r\n\r\nIn my current and previous roles, I have led design efforts on a variety of high-impact projects, increasing user engagement by 25% and reducing drop-off rates by 15%. I specialize in designing intuitive interfaces, conducting usability testing, and refining designs to ensure both functionality and aesthetics are met. My technical proficiency in tools like Figma, Adobe XD, and Webflow, along with my skills in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, allows me to effectively collaborate with development teams to ensure seamless implementation.\r\n\r\nI am passionate about staying updated with the latest design trends and applying design thinking principles to craft responsive and interactive user experiences. Whether working on websites, applications, or complex platforms, my focus is always on delivering designs that resonate with users and enhance their overall experience.\r\n\r\nI would welcome the opportunity to contribute my skills to your team and am confident that my collaborative mindset and attention to detail will bring value to your projects. I am available at +91 9044542535 or via email at nemesisgraphic19@gmail.com, and I look forward to discussing how I can contribute to future design endeavors.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nMohd Aquib bin Javed\r\nUI/UX Designer & Web Designer\r\nhttps://aquibdesigner.site/', 'true', '2025-03-15', '10:47:56AM'),
(1005, 'Reetu Gupta', 'reetu.gupta703@gmail.com', '07355235259', 'Any Other', '467a5a87d202223e69c86f6dcb6ea113_resume.pdf', 'Subject: Job Application – Reetu Gupta\r\n\r\nDear Hiring Team at DigiCoders,\r\nI hope you are doing well. I am writing to apply for a suitable position at DigiCoders. I have attached my resume for your reference.\r\nI am an MCA graduate with a strong foundation in frontend development, particularly in React and JavaScript. I am eager to contribute my skills and grow as a developer with your esteemed organization.\r\nI would appreciate the opportunity to discuss my application further. Please let me know if any additional information is required.\r\nLooking forward to your response.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nReetu Gupta\r\nPhone: 07355235259\r\nEmail: reetu.gupta703@gmail.com', 'true', '2025-03-15', '11:56:07AM'),
