(1059, 'moh Arman Siddiqui', 'moharmansiddiqui@gmail.com', '7619934125', 'Any Other', '078cd478dcd8969d4183d573d9626bb1_resume.pdf', 'With a strong foundation in frontend and backend technologies and a passion for problem-solving, I am eager to contribute to your team while further developing my skills in a real-world environment.\r\nCurrently pursuing my Master of Computer Applications (MCA) at Galgotias College of Engineering and Technology, Greater Noida, I have gained hands-on experience in backend development through several projects. My proficiency in Node.js, Express.js, and MongoDB has allowed me to build full-fledged applications like a CRUD-based To-Do application. Additionally, my knowledge of C++, MySQL strengthens my problem-solving abilities and adaptability to new technologies.\r\nI have also worked on a variety of projects that highlight my full-stack capabilities:\r\n• Password Generator (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) – A web-based tool that generates strong, customizable passwords.\r\n• Bookstore API (Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB) – A RESTful API supporting full CRUD operations for books, authors, and users.\r\n• Portfolio Website (HTML, Tailwind CSS) – A simple yet effective website to showcase my projects and skills.\r\n', 'true', '2025-03-30', '01:43:35AM'),
