(1093, 'Kashifa Idreesi', 'kashifa.idreesi779@gmail.com', '8840720331', 'Any Other', 'bca43a1f7c84510046671700ba42118c_resume.pdf', 'Hii,\r\n\r\nI am Kashifa Idreesi excited to apply for the SEO or Digital Marketing Executive role at Digi Coders. With two years of hands-on experience in SEO, social media marketing, content creation, email campaigns, Google Ads, and performance analytics, I am passionate about crafting strategies that drive engagement, generate leads, and build strong brand presence in the digital space.\r\n\r\nMost recently, I worked at Vexil Infotech Pvt. Ltd. as a Digital Marketing Executive, where I led multi-channel campaigns, enhanced organic reach through strategic SEO efforts, and executed performance-driven paid ad campaigns across Google and Meta platforms.\r\n\r\nPrior to that, I contributed to the digital growth of Saroj Educational Group, GD Goenka Public School, and Bito Technologies, where I helped strengthen their online presence, produce engaging content, and generate leads through creative, data-informed marketing initiatives.\r\n\r\nI hold an Executive Post Graduate Certification in Digital Marketing and Analytics from IIT Roorkee, a HubSpot Email Marketing Certification, and other relevant certifications in digital marketing tools and strategies. I also hold a Bachelor’s degree in Economics from Lucknow University, which has equipped me with strong analytical and research skills.\r\n\r\nI am proficient in tools such as Google Analytics, SEMrush, Meta Business Suite, Ubersuggest, and Ahrefs, and I actively stay up to date with the latest industry trends to deliver effective and innovative campaigns.\r\n\r\nBeyond the metrics, I truly enjoy the creative process of telling a brand’s story through strategy and content. My background in campaign execution, performance tracking, and user-focused marketing makes me confident in my ability to support your team’s goals and drive measurable success.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I would be thrilled to bring my creativity, analytical mindset, and digital expertise to your team. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your marketing efforts.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nKashifa Idreesi', 'true', '2025-04-10', '11:32:59AM'),
