(1155, 'Waqar Ahmad', 'ahmadwaqar065@gmail.com', '9453995653', 'Any Other', '9308ba76b9a0ed5781be963383b1d50c_resume.pdf', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI am currently seeking a job opportunity as a full stack developer .I am experienced in developing healthcare software aligned with FHIR standards and have a background in ServiceNow and MySQL development. With 4+ years of overall experience and wored with two of big mnc. I am an immediate joiner\r\n\r\nI have attached my resume for your review. Please feel free to contact me for any suitable opportunities.', 'true', '2025-05-01', '12:59:18AM'),
(1156, 'Saket ', 'saketjuet2020@gmail.com', '9676487524', 'Any Other', 'f400d19dd7c1aae3ed15e744586f10b8_resume.pdf', 'This is Saket . I worked at A3logics Jaipur as EDI Analyst from Jun 24 to Jan 7. As an EDI Analyst I have managed EDI solutions, ensuring seamless data transmission. I have integrated systems and optimised the process.Map and translate data from internal systems (e.g., ERP) to EDI formats (e.g., ANSI X12, EDIFACT), ensuring compatibility and accuracy.Troubleshoot EDI transaction errors, resolve issues with data exchanges, and communicate with vendors or internal teams to resolve discrepancies.\r\nThe skills I have learned are Salesforce, SQL, Excel, XML.\r\nI have completed Btech from Jaypee University in 2024 and I have completed Data Science internship also from Yoshops.com\r\n\r\nI left my previous company due to personal issues.\r\nAnd I am comfortable with the bond also .And currently I am comfortable relocating also .\r\nI am a immediate joiner also \r\nMy ke skills are -\r\nPython,  C++,Power Bi, Excel ,HTML, CSS, Basic knowledge of JavaScript, SQL, Machine Learning , data science, Software testing', 'true', '2025-05-01', '09:35:11AM'),
