(1166, 'Akshay Singh Patel', 'akshaysinghpatell@gmail.com', '8957451608', 'Any Other', '235ca04cab8c516318956aa3a359e2de_resume.pdf', 'I am a passionate and driven software developer with expertise in React.js, Java (Spring Boot), and full-stack web development. With a strong focus on building responsive, user-centric applications, I thrive in creating efficient, scalable solutions that meet both business and user needs. I am constantly eager to learn and grow, and I enjoy collaborating on impactful projects that drive innovation and improve user experience. I am actively looking for new opportunities and would love to join any open roles that align with my skills and passion.', 'true', '2025-05-04', '11:11:19AM'),
