(1168, 'Ashutosh Mishra ', 'ash10f@gmail.com', '8052162418', 'Any Other', '5e6b7b8a9255eff812e679e75571c1ef_resume.pdf', 'Dear HR,\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\nMy name is Ashutosh Mishra, and I am writing to express my interest in a Frontend Developer internship opportunity at Digicoders. I have a strong foundation in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, along with a basic understanding of React.js. In addition to my technical skills, I have completed several freelance projects involving website design and development, which have strengthened my practical experience and creative approach to frontend development.\r\n\r\nI am passionate about building responsive and user-friendly web interfaces, and I am eager to further develop my skills while contributing to your team. I am confident that my combination of technical knowledge and hands-on freelance experience would allow me to add value to your projects while learning and growing under your guidance.\r\n\r\nI would love the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Digicoders and am available for an interview at your convenience. I have attached my resume and portfolio for your reference.\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to hearing from you!\r\nBest regards,\r\nAshutosh Mishra\r\n8052162418\r\nashu10f@gmail.com\r\nwww.linkedin.com/in/ashutosh-mishra-066ab8236', 'true', '2025-05-04', '09:39:15PM'),
(1169, 'Ashutosh Mishra ', 'ash10f@gmail.com', '8052162418', 'Any Other', '121b9ae35cbc153e67dff558caae0c4c_resume.pdf', 'Dear HR,\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\nMy name is Ashutosh Mishra, and I am writing to express my interest in a Frontend Developer internship opportunity at Digicoders. I have a strong foundation in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, along with a basic understanding of React.js. In addition to my technical skills, I have completed several freelance projects involving website design and development, which have strengthened my practical experience and creative approach to frontend development.\r\n\r\nI am passionate about building responsive and user-friendly web interfaces, and I am eager to further develop my skills while contributing to your team. I am confident that my combination of technical knowledge and hands-on freelance experience would allow me to add value to your projects while learning and growing under your guidance.\r\n\r\nI would love the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to Digicoders and am available for an interview at your convenience. I have attached my resume and portfolio for your reference.\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to hearing from you!\r\nBest regards,\r\nAshutosh Mishra\r\n8052162418\r\nashu10f@gmail.com\r\nwww.linkedin.com/in/ashutosh-mishra-066ab8236', 'true', '2025-05-04', '09:39:17PM'),
(1170, 'Akshay Kumar Verma', 'akshayashokverma@gmail.com', '8318911146', 'Any Other', 'b0370b5e0e3b66e444619956379e7393_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\nI am writing to express my interest in opportunities within the field of Data Science, where I can\r\nleverage my extensive expertise in data analysis and machine learning to drive impactful business\r\nsolutions. With a strong foundation in data analytics, honed through my role as a Research\r\nAssistant at IIT Roorkee, I have developed a keen ability to extract actionable insights from complex\r\ndatasets and contribute to innovative projects, such as bus route optimization and power\r\nconsumption prediction for electric vehicles.\r\nMy technical proficiency in Python, SQL, and advanced analytics tools, combined with hands-on\r\nexperience in developing predictive models, positions me well to tackle real-world data challenges.\r\nI have successfully collaborated with cross-functional teams to design tailored solutions that\r\nenhance operational efficiency and support strategic decision-making. My recent internship at\r\nMagnus IT Solutions further solidified my skills in data visualization and analysis, enabling me to\r\ncreate interactive dashboards that facilitate informed choices.\r\nI am particularly drawn to roles that allow me to explore untapped business opportunities and\r\ncontribute to data-driven decision-making processes. My proactive approach and strong\r\ncommunication skills enable me to thrive in dynamic environments, ensuring that I can effectively\r\nconvey complex data findings to stakeholders.\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my\r\nskills and experiences align with your needs.\r\nSincerely,\r\nAkshay Kumar Verma', 'true', '2025-05-05', '05:04:18PM'),
