(1175, 'Hariom Kaushal', 'hkaushal72000@gmail.com', '7704069809', 'Any Other', '169662659b48d3318b4eb92997e2a0d4_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Java Developer position at Digi{Coders}. With a B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering from the Indian Institute of Information Technology Vadodara and practical experience in full-stack development, I am confident in my ability to contribute meaningfully to your team.\r\n\r\nCurrently, I serve as a Software Developer at Care Group Sight Solutions, where I have led the development of enterprise-level applications using Java, Java Swing, and JDBC. One of my key projects involved building a role-based ticket support system to streamline IT issue resolution. I also created a PHP and SQL Server–based Asset Management platform, which replaced a manual process with a fully digital and efficient solution—enhancing operational speed and accuracy.\r\n\r\nIn addition to my software development work, I provide SAP functional support in the PP and MM modules, which has strengthened my skills in process management and cross-functional collaboration. I am well-versed in development tools such as NetBeans, Visual Studio Code, and SQL Server, and I bring a strong understanding of database design and application architecture.\r\n\r\nI am excited about the opportunity to bring my technical skills, problem-solving ability, and passion for innovation to Digi{Coders} Technologies. I would welcome the chance to contribute to your development initiatives and grow within your team.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to speak with you further.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nHariom Kaushal', 'true', '2025-05-06', '11:21:02AM'),
(1176, 'Harshit Verma', 'harshitverma2306@gmail.com', '08707095416', 'Any Other', 'd7b3d485c705395dfa63b619df3d8d2f_resume.pdf', 'I am an enthusiastic and self-motivated professional with a strong foundation in quality assurance and software testing. I thrive in dynamic and competitive environments that promote continuous learning and professional development. With a keen eye for detail and a passion for ensuring product quality, I aim to leverage my analytical, problem-solving, and organizational skills to deliver reliable and high-performing solutions. My goal is to secure a responsible position where I can utilize my training, experience, and dedication to contribute meaningfully to the success and growth of the company.', 'true', '2025-05-06', '02:37:19PM'),
(1177, 'Shivam Gupta', 'ramprasadg469@gmail.com', '8602507957', 'Any Other', '0d089e2357480a1ecd914664370eeb26_resume.pdf', 'Dear HR,\r\n\r\nI hope you are doing well. My name is Shivam Gupta, and I am writing to express my strong interest in the Laravel Developer position at your esteemed organization. I have over 1 year and 3 months of hands-on experience as a Full-Stack Developer, primarily working with Laravel, MySQL, JavaScript, and Bootstrap. I have successfully built multiple industrial-level modules, including purchase management, product tracking, and dynamic form processing.\r\n\r\nCurrently, I am working remotely at Anjali Computers, Gwalior, where I have gained practical experience with real-time applications, database management, and full project development. I am highly passionate about backend development, eager to contribute to impactful projects, and open to relocating for the right opportunity.\r\n\r\nI would be grateful for the opportunity to contribute my skills to your team and further discuss how I can add value.\r\nPlease find my resume attached for your consideration.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your response.\r\nThank you for your time.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nShivam Gupta\r\n8602507957\r\nramprasadg469@gmail.com', 'true', '2025-05-08', '11:02:50AM'),
