(1180, 'Anjali Srivastava', 'srivastavaanjali547@gmail.com', '09569408426', 'Any Other', '50c2efb16340dcdf5a8b32dfcf5f234e_resume.pdf', 'Subject: Application for Web Developer Position\r\n\r\nDear Digicoders Team,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Web Developer position at Digicoders. With a strong background in front-end and back-end web development, particularly in technologies like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React.js, and Node.js, I am eager to contribute to your innovative team and help build high-quality web solutions.\r\n\r\nI am passionate about clean code, responsive design, and delivering excellent user experiences. I would love the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with your team’s needs and contribute to your ongoing success.\r\n\r\nPlease find my resume attached for your review. I look forward to the possibility of connecting with you.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nAnjali Srivastava\r\n9569408426\r\nsrivastavaanjali547@gmail.com\r\n', 'true', '2025-05-09', '05:22:20PM'),
