(1185, 'Rajat Kumar Pandey', 'raj.kumar.pandey.ay@gmail.com', '09956062653', 'Any Other', '755caf21fc0c40f5269c0574ab44a9fc_resume.pdf', 'I hope this message finds you well.\r\n\r\nI’m Rajat Pandey, a final-year BCA student at Chandigarh University, graduating in June 2025, and I’m currently seeking software development opportunities that align with my passion for full-stack development and systems engineering.\r\n\r\nI bring a strong blend of technical expertise and practical experience. I\'m currently building a full-stack project using Node.js, Express.js, React.js, and MySQL, and I’ve also worked extensively with Java, Spring Boot, React.js, and MS SQL Server to develop scalable ERP and Visitor Management Systems (VMS). My responsibilities span developing RESTful APIs, designing secure backend logic, and creating dynamic, user-friendly frontends for enterprise-grade applications.\r\n\r\nBeyond development, I have hands-on experience deploying applications in Linux environments, writing shell scripts for automation, and understanding networking protocols such as TCP/IP, ARP, and routing. I’ve also had the opportunity to lead small teams, adapt to fast-paced project changes, and ensure timely delivery of high-performance solutions.\r\n\r\nMy ability to work across the tech stack, combined with a problem-solving mindset and eagerness to learn, makes me a strong candidate for roles in dynamic and collaborative environments like yours.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I’ve attached my resume for your reference and would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nRajat Pandey', 'true', '2025-05-12', '12:33:40PM'),
