(1197, 'Shivanshu Gupta', 'shivanshu2019gupta@gmail.com', '7440248190', 'Any Other', 'e42e7aec69f709229ab63187442776ae_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in a Full Stack Developer or Software Developer role at your organization. As a postgraduate student in Computer Applications and a passionate developer with hands-on experience in building full-stack applications, I am excited to contribute my skills and enthusiasm to dynamic teams working on real-world tech solutions.\r\n\r\nCurrently, I am working as a Full Stack Development Intern at Almanet Professional Services, where I am contributing to a live project using Next.js, React.js, MySQL, and other modern web technologies. This experience has helped me sharpen my practical knowledge in frontend and backend development, code modularity, API integration, and user-focused design.\r\n\r\nI have also built personal and academic projects like Clank (an image voting app), a Hotel Booking Website, and an Online Grocery Selling Platform, using technologies such as TypeScript, MongoDB, PostgreSQL, Node.js, Docker, and more. These projects demonstrate my ability to build scalable and efficient applications from scratch.\r\n\r\nI am a quick learner and always open to exploring new technologies as per the project’s need. I take pride in writing clean, maintainable code and collaborating effectively with team members. I am currently seeking an opportunity where I can learn, grow, and contribute meaningfully to impactful software solutions.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to bring value to your team and further discuss how my background and passion for development align with your needs.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nShivanshu Gupta', 'true', '2025-05-17', '11:16:23PM'),
