(1201, 'Jeeshan Ahmad Khan', 'erjeeshankhan@gmail.com', '09369991359', 'Any Other', '72d23b3bd4a2e649d3243b0defeddedd_resume.pdf', 'Dear HR,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Sr. Automation Test Engineer. I bring over 8 years of total experience, including 6 years in software development and test automation, with a strong background in Selenium WebDriver, Java, TestNG, Maven, and frameworks based on the Page Object Model and Singleton design pattern.\r\n\r\nIn my current role as a Quality Analyst, I have built and maintained robust automation test suites that have significantly reduced manual testing efforts. My experience also includes API testing, database validations, and integration with CI/CD tools to support agile development and regular releases\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I have hands-on experience in non-functional testing, such as load testing using JMeter, to ensure performance and reliability.\r\n\r\nPlease find my resume attached for your consideration. I would welcome the opportunity to further discuss how my skills and experience can contribute to your QA goals.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the possibility of contributing to your team\'s success.\r\n\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nJeeshan Ahmad Khan\r\n+919369991359', 'true', '2025-05-18', '10:15:25PM'),
