(1227, 'Shubham Chauhan', 'shubhamchauhanbhagat@gmail.com', '9369251477', 'Any Other', '321d3fa9f0908e0c32e05109a52b0b8b_resume.pdf', 'I am writing to express my interest in any suitable opportunity at Digicoders. I have a strong foundation in front-end development (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React) and am also proficient in C++ and SQL, allowing me to contribute effectively to both user-facing features and backend data handling.\r\n\r\nI am enthusiastic about applying my skills in a dynamic and growth-oriented environment like yours. Please find my resume attached for your consideration. I would be grateful for the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.', 'true', '2025-05-25', '09:30:37AM'),
