(1233, 'Shivam Shukla ', 'shivamshukla.email@gmail.com', '7985218893', 'Any Other', 'e2ee05413b46b989affe83b7dc5c8b0b_resume.pdf', 'Hey,\r\n\r\nHope you\'re doing well. I\'m a BCA student at the Dr. Virendra Swarup College of Management Studies(CSJMU), Kanpur, and I am really interested for the job opportunity as a Web Developer.\r\n\r\nI made S-mart which is an e-commerce app using NEXT.js in TypeScript, also used various libraries like GSAP for animation, NextAuth for authentication. I\'ve also made an employee management system using java, Spring boot, MySQL and Spring security.\r\n\r\nI recently made a group video calling app Camly which uses SFU and hosted its backend at Amazon AWS EC2, I used Typescript with MERN stack technology in this project \r\n\r\nThe live links are here \r\nGroup video calling app - Camly = https://its-shivam1008.github.io/camly/\r\n\r\nE-commerce app = s-mart-blush.vercel.app\r\n\r\nVoting app = vote-govern.vercel.app\r\n\r\nYou can check out my projects on my GitHub \r\n\r\nI\'ve attached my resume for your reference. Please, let me know if you have any questions. I look forward to your response\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nShivam Shukla \r\n\r\nLinkedin: https://www.linkedin.com/in/shivam-shukla0001\r\n\r\nGitHub Profile : https://github.com/its-shivam1008', 'true', '2025-05-27', '02:10:12PM'),
