(1327, 'Shiv Pratap Singh Yadav', 'shivpratapsinghyadav38@gmail.com', '8349923804', 'Any Other', '459fe84c7a1ffaff5883462faee80e2b_resume.pdf', 'Frontend Developer with 2+ years of experience specializing in React, Redux, Vue, and React Native.\r\nProven expertise in building high-performance, scalable web and mobile applications. Played a key role\r\nin developing and owning a comprehensive Fleet Management System dashboard with real-time tracking,\r\nanalytics, and 3D vehicle visualization. Actively working on a React Native-based ordering app for a\r\nforeign client for over a year, focused on seamless user experience and performance. Skilled in modern UI\r\nlibraries like Material-UI and Tailwind CSS, with a strong focus on user-centric design and cross-platform\r\ndevelopment.', 'true', '2025-07-07', '02:02:37AM'),
