(1330, 'Rajan yadav', 'rajanyadav.pwn@gmail.com', '9696436997', 'Any Other', '938a16c5fa6c69ac5efc92754108711e_resume.pdf', 'Subject: Application for Opportunity at DigiCoders Technologies\r\n\r\nMessage:\r\n\r\nDear DigiCoders Team,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\n\r\nMy name is Rajan Yadav, and I am writing to express my interest in joining your esteemed organization. As a passionate and dedicated learner with a background in web development and software engineering, I am excited about the opportunity to contribute to your innovative and inspiring team.\r\nI have developed multiple real-world projects, including a travel website, a weather app, and a language translator web app. I am confident that my technical skills, problem-solving ability, and enthusiasm for continuous learning would make me a valuable asset to your team.\r\n\r\nI have attached my resume for your reference and would be grateful for the chance to discuss any opportunities available at DigiCoders Technologies.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your positive response.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nRajan Yadav\r\nrajanyadav.pwn@gmail.com\r\n???? 9696436997', 'true', '2025-07-07', '10:17:48AM'),
