(1332, 'Janhvi Srivastava', 'janhvisrivastava2020@gmail.com', '9651134446', 'Any Other', '33707406e6e6346385e0e92d7ba6566d_resume.pdf', 'Janhvi Srivastava\r\nLucknow, India\r\njanhvisrivastava2020@gmail.com\r\n+91 9651134446\r\nDate: 05 July 2025\r\n\r\nSubject: Application for HR Opportunities\r\n\r\nDear HR Team,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\nI am writing to express my interest in any Human Resource (HR) opportunities—particularly in operations or executive roles—within your esteemed organization. I hold MBA with a major in Human Resources and a minor in Digital Marketing. Currently, I am working with Prayosha Food Service Pvt. Ltd. as RM\r\n\r\nMy previous experiences include:\r\n\r\n* HR Intern at Tudip Technologies Pvt. Ltd. – 3 months\r\n* HR Intern at Seva Satkar Foundation – 6 months\r\n* Marketing Intern at Career 360 - 3 months\r\n\r\nSome of the key skills:\r\n* Strong communication and interpersonal abilities\r\n* Performance management\r\n* Employee relations\r\n* Training and development initiatives\r\n* HRIS\r\n\r\nI am enthusiastic about the opportunity to contribute meaningfully to your HR team and would welcome a chance to discuss how my background aligns with your company’s needs.\r\n\r\nPlease find my resume attached for your review. Thank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to connect further.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nJanhvi Srivastava', 'true', '2025-07-07', '08:45:59PM'),
