(1350, 'Ankit Thakur', 'rajankitt01@gmail.com', '07667930518', 'Any Other', '773641a1820516ccf9ead5c1cddec789_resume.pdf', 'I am excited to apply for the Web Developer/Software Developer Fresher role at Digicoders. With a B.Tech in Computer Science & Engineering (2020-2024) and hands-on experience in Java, JavaScript, HTML5, CSS3, Bootstrap, and MySQL, I have built responsive web applications and robust systems like a Cold Storage Management System and an E-Learning Evaluation platform. I am eager to contribute my technical skills and collaborative mindset to your innovative team. Please find my resume attached. I am available at rajankitt01@gmail.com or (+91) 765793538 for further discussion.', 'true', '2025-07-15', '02:56:01AM'),
