(1413, 'Anshika Maurya', 'mauryaanshika03@gmail.com', '9336419061', 'Any Other', '2600b3c960213a1114f5b508cd735d19_resume.pdf', 'I am excited to apply for an opportunity in UI/UX design at your company. I have a strong interest in creating visually appealing and user-friendly experiences, and I am eager to contribute my creativity, dedication, and fresh perspective to your team.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your response.', 'true', '2025-08-11', '03:56:40PM'),
