(1415, 'Divyansh Patel  ', 'divyanshpatel40@gmail.com', '9161431585', 'Any Other', '6120fc181498b91c1952607872180be3_resume.pdf', 'Dear HR Manager,\r\n\r\nI hope you\'re doing well.\r\n\r\nMy name is DIVYANSH PATEL, and I recently completed my Graduation in BVOC(Software Development & E-Governance) from National PG College, Lucknow. I am reaching out to express my keen interest in starting my career as a Front-End Web Developer.\r\n\r\nAlthough I am a recent graduate, I have gained hands-on experience through personal projects, internships,and coursework. I am proficient in core front-end Web Developer technologies like HTML, CSS, JavScript, and React and many more.I am excited about the opportunity to apply these skills in a real-world setting.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to speak with you further.\r\n\r\nBest Regards,\r\nDIVYANSH PATEL\r\ndivyanshpatel40@gmail.com', 'true', '2025-08-12', '11:36:30AM'),
(1416, 'Divyansh Patel  ', 'divyanshpatel40@gmail.com', '9161431585', 'Any Other', 'f5eea6e3fdb2056ee891cf00e0eb8ebb_resume.pdf', 'Dear HR Manager,\r\n\r\nI hope you\'re doing well.\r\n\r\nMy name is DIVYANSH PATEL, and I recently completed my Graduation in BVOC(Software Development & E-Governance) from National PG College, Lucknow. I am reaching out to express my keen interest in starting my career as a Front-End Web Developer.\r\n\r\nAlthough I am a recent graduate, I have gained hands-on experience through personal projects, internships,and coursework. I am proficient in core front-end Web Developer technologies like HTML, CSS, JavScript, and React and many more.I am excited about the opportunity to apply these skills in a real-world setting.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to speak with you further.\r\n\r\nBest Regards,\r\nDIVYANSH PATEL\r\ndivyanshpatel40@gmail.com', 'true', '2025-08-12', '11:36:31AM'),
(1417, 'Manish Mishra', 'Manishmagento15@gmail.com', '9151760957', 'Any Other', 'a3727e13988e09ad0125c70e2b4356df_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Magento Developer position. With over eight and half years of experience in backend development and project management—specializing in Magento—I bring a strong track record of delivering high-performance, scalable, and secure eCommerce solutions.\r\n\r\nMy expertise spans custom module development, API integrations, bug fixing, and performance optimization, all aligned with industry best practices. I take pride in producing clean, maintainable code and delivering solutions that align with business goals and user needs.\r\n\r\nI am currently seeking a full-time opportunity where I can contribute meaningfully and continue to grow as a developer. While I prefer remote work arrangements, I am flexible regarding compensation based on the work model. I am also open to relocation, provided appropriate support for transition is available.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I would welcome the opportunity to further discuss how my skills and experience align with your team’s needs and contribute to your ongoing success.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nManish Mishra\r\nContact No.: 9151760957', 'true', '2025-08-12', '12:30:21PM'),
