(1423, 'Ashraf Ali', 'ashrafali64560@gmail.com', '6307654691', 'Any Other', '204f486f5e3473670813513109108044_resume.pdf', 'Subject: Application for .NET Developer Position\r\n\r\nHello,\r\n\r\nI am applying for the role of .NET Developer at DigiCoders.\r\nI have completed training in ASP.NET MVC, C#, HTML,CSS,JavaScript, SQL, and Bootstrap, along with practical experience building projects such as E-Commerce Website, Blog Application.\r\n\r\nAs I have previously learned at DigiCoders, I am familiar with your professional environment and culture, and I am eager to contribute my skills to your innovative team. I am confident that my technical knowledge and passion for development will make me a valuable addition.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nAshraf Ali', 'true', '2025-08-15', '02:24:29PM'),
