(1426, 'Roli Sharma', 'sharmaroli9250@gmail.com', '9250119026', 'Any Other', 'cfa36222e9b3c620be9a3b6cea34cdbe_resume.pdf', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Web Developer position at DigiCoders. With experience in building responsive and dynamic web applications using Angular, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript , I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your development team.\r\nIn my previous role, I have worked on projects involving user-friendly interfaces, API integrations, and scalable web solutions. I enjoy solving complex problems, writing clean code, and collaborating with teams to deliver high-quality products.\r\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience align with the needs of your team. Please find my resume attached for your review.\r\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you.\r\n ', 'true', '2025-08-16', '11:02:04AM'),
(1427, 'Abhishek Singh', 'singhabhishek2203@gmail.com', '9984916814', 'Any Other', '10544c11406e2c24b0cfa75436f63346_resume.pdf', 'I am writing to express my interest in the Web Developer position at DigiCoders. With experience in building responsive and dynamic web applications using Angular, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript , I am confident in my ability to contribute effectively to your development team.\r\nIn my previous role, I have worked on projects involving user-friendly interfaces, API integrations, and scalable web solutions. I enjoy solving complex problems, writing clean code, and collaborating with teams to deliver high-quality products.\r\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my skills and experience align with the needs of your team. Please find my resume attached for your review.\r\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you.\r\n ', 'true', '2025-08-16', '11:03:07AM'),
