(1429, 'Mohammad Zahir', 'mohammadzahir334@gmail.com', '6306924549', 'Any Other', '62183aa80fdfd4ab4ac444ae7d990d5e_resume.pdf', 'I am a recent BCA graduate with skills in frontend development using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, and Bootstrap. I am a quick learner, motivated to grow in the IT field, and eager to contribute my knowledge to build user-friendly and efficient web applications.', 'true', '2025-08-18', '04:13:57AM'),
