(1442, 'Shweta Priya ', 'shwetapriya211@gmail.com', '7645059699', 'Any Other', '799345f67dd0607a13b7953202ddfdc0_resume.pdf', 'To drive agriculture-focused digital transformation by leveraging my\r\nexpertise in scalable API integration, ASP.NET, SQL Server, and system\r\ndesign. Passionate about empowering farmers and strengthening agri-\r\nvalue chains through e-Governance platforms and Digital Public\r\nInfrastructure (DPI) such as Aadhaar. Committed to contributing to\r\nprojects that upskill farmers, build sustainable agritech ecosystems\r\nthrough public-private partnerships (PPP), and deliver measurable,\r\ncitizen-centric impact.', 'true', '2025-08-22', '12:52:06PM'),
