(1463, 'Virendra kumar', 'virendraec1035@gmail.com', '9506877430', 'Any Other', '75b80f2b3caecb8cd17202a204aa9da9_resume.pdf', 'Dear Sir/Ma\'am\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\n\r\nI have over 2 years of experience as a Java Developer at Mastek Ltd., where I gained strong technical and implementation skills through hands-on work in software development, deployment, and user support. My experience includes requirement analysis, solution design, troubleshooting, and collaborating closely with cross-functional teams to deliver IT solutions that drive efficiency and business results.\r\n\r\nI am eager to leverage my technical expertise and passion for problem-solving in a new and challenging role at Mtree. I am confident that my background in Java development and experience handling end-to-end project implementations make me a strong fit for your team.\r\nI am sharing our resume for your reference.\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss my qualifications further.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nVirendra Kumar\r\nSoftware Engineer\r\n\r\n', 'true', '2025-09-02', '10:27:06PM'),
