(1466, 'Aadarsh Soni', 'aadarshsoni.dev@gmail.com', '7869499899', 'Any Other', 'c5563072120bf69c1b645526a43f666c_resume.pdf', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI really loved what you were building and wanted to reach out to see if there are any openings for a UI/UX Engineer / Full-Stack Developer role. I am currently pursuing my B.Tech in Computer Science at OP Jindal University (GPA 8.11/10) and have gained strong hands-on experience through multiple internships and projects where I designed and developed scalable applications, both web and mobile.\r\n\r\nOver the past few years, I have worked across several early-stage teams, taking responsibility for designing intuitive user interfaces in Figma and implementing full-stack systems with Next.js, React, Node.js, Express, Prisma, and PostgreSQL. At Binimise Labs, I contributed to modules like Task Management, Project Management, Expense Tracking, and Asset Management by building frontend components with Next.js and secure backend APIs with Feathers.js. At BlueDot (Ireland), I led end-to-end UI/UX design while also developing and maintaining cross-platform mobile apps in React Native, optimising performance and reducing crash rates. With Thanima and Roadlyne, I worked closely with stakeholders to design mobile and web platforms, creating wireframes, prototypes, and design systems that were implemented successfully by engineering teams. At Bridge Healthcare, I designed the UI for TradeGospel and a healthcare tracking machine (currently live at Varanasi Railway Station), ensuring compliance, accessibility, and usability. Most recently, at Ainrion, I delivered a production-ready website by owning the UI/UX process from conceptualisation to deployment.\r\n\r\nAlongside internships, I have built and deployed multiple production-grade projects. My Stock Management App was a full-stack inventory system using Next.js 15, Prisma, and PostgreSQL, with features like JWT authentication, stock transfers, and real-time reporting, deployed on Vercel & Supabase. I also developed a Web File Sharing Platform with secure file uploads, access control, and a modern ShadCN-based dashboard. The Alumni Association System was another end-to-end platform built with React, Node.js, Express, and MongoDB, enabling alumni registration, events, and communication. Finally, my Tech Learner – AI-Based Training System combined AI/ML-driven personalised learning, Spring Security, and MySQL to create a cohesive training platform that improved employee engagement and skill adoption.\r\n\r\nIn terms of recognition, I have been a Finalist at Smart India Hackathon (2023, 2024) and Young Innovators Challenge (2024), and a Winner at Tech-Lab (2023), where my projects were recognised for innovation and impact.\r\n\r\nTechnically, I am comfortable across frontend (React.js, Next.js, React Native, Tailwind, ShadCN UI), backend (Node.js, Express, Prisma, Feathers.js, Python, Spring Security), and databases (PostgreSQL, MySQL, MongoDB, Firebase, Supabase), with strong design expertise in Figma and Adobe Photoshop. I also bring knowledge of deployment pipelines with Vercel, Render, and Supabase, authentication (JWT, Clerk, Firebase Auth), and collaborative product design.\r\n\r\nI would love to be part of an early-stage team & contributing to design, engineering, and product development while also defining the team’s culture. Looking forward to hearing from you soon!\r\n\r\n\r\nBest,\r\nAadarsh Soni\r\n+917869499899\r\naadarshsoni.dev@gmail.com\r\n', 'true', '2025-09-05', '06:54:15AM'),
