(1492, 'ishav sharma', 'ishav.sharma02@gmail.com', '7340023113', 'Any Other', 'e2e44d7962bf424b409bb51966f25932_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Data Analyst – Fresher role. I have recently completed my B.Tech degree and I am eager to begin my career in data analytics. With skills in SQL, Excel, Python, and Power BI/Tableau, I am confident in my ability to contribute to data-driven decision-making processes.\r\n\r\nDuring my academic projects and self-learning, I worked on data cleaning, visualization, and analysis tasks using real-world datasets. For example, I created dashboards to track sales performance and applied statistical methods to uncover patterns and trends. These experiences helped me develop a structured approach to problem-solving along with an eye for detail.\r\n\r\nWhat excites me most is the opportunity to apply my analytical skills, adaptability, and eagerness to learn in a professional environment. I am confident that I can grow with the organization while adding value to the team.\r\n\r\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background and skills align with the requirements of this role. Thank you for considering my application.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nishav sharma', 'true', '2025-09-19', '08:40:25PM'),
(1493, 'ishav sharma', 'ishav.sharma02@gmail.com', '7340023113', 'Any Other', '8450bc3d36bc32008c6bb822791adaee_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Data Analyst – Fresher role. I have recently completed my B.Tech degree and I am eager to begin my career in data analytics. With skills in SQL, Excel, Python, and Power BI/Tableau, I am confident in my ability to contribute to data-driven decision-making processes.\r\n\r\nDuring my academic projects and self-learning, I worked on data cleaning, visualization, and analysis tasks using real-world datasets. For example, I created dashboards to track sales performance and applied statistical methods to uncover patterns and trends. These experiences helped me develop a structured approach to problem-solving along with an eye for detail.\r\n\r\nWhat excites me most is the opportunity to apply my analytical skills, adaptability, and eagerness to learn in a professional environment. I am confident that I can grow with the organization while adding value to the team.\r\n\r\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how my background and skills align with the requirements of this role. Thank you for considering my application.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nishav sharma', 'true', '2025-09-19', '08:40:27PM'),
