(1515, 'Rishabh Singh', 'rishabhs2088@gmail.com', '09984821102', 'Any Other', '44ac9e6a604a3b5b2a1d367f3ed9291e_resume.pdf', 'Subject: Application for Java Backend Developer Position - Rishabh Singh\r\nDear Hiring Manager or HR Team,\r\nI am writing to express my strong interest in the Java Backend Developer position. With a Master of Computer Applications degree and hands-on experience in building scalable applications, I am confident in my ability to immediately contribute to your team.\r\nMy profile is centered around being an aspiring Full-stack and Backend Java Developer with experience in Java, SQL, and the MERN stack.I am skilled in developing REST APIs, utilizing Spring Boot, and implementing authentication workflows.  \r\nRelevant Experience and Skills\r\nMy qualifications align well with the requirements for a backend-focused role:\r\nJava and Frameworks: I have core proficiency in Java, SQL, and key frameworks like Hibernate and Spring Boot.  \r\nAPI Development: My experience includes developing over 20 REST APIs for accounts, sessions, and book management.  \r\nAuthentication & Security: I have secured transactions using JWT authentication.  \r\nProblem-Solving: I am passionate about problem-solving and focused on delivering real-world solutions.  \r\nDuring my Web Developer Intern role at HipsterSG India Pvt. Ltd., I gained practical experience in a fast-paced, mentor-driven environment.I utilized skills from my Summer Training in MERN Stack to develop a full-stack application and implement secure features.  \r\nI am eager to leverage my technical skills and enthusiasm for backend development to contribute to your projects. Thank you for considering my application. I have attached my resume for your detailed review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills can benefit your team.\r\nSincerely,\r\nRishabh Singh\r\nRae Bareli, Uttar Pradesh\r\n+91-9984821102\r\nrishabhs2088@gmail.com\r\nLinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/rishabh-singh2088  \r\nProject- Online Bookstore - https://book-store-app-psi-henna.vercel.app/Subject: Application for Java Backend Developer Position - Rishabh Singh\r\nDear Hiring Manager or HR Team,\r\nI am writing to express my strong interest in the Java Backend Developer position. With a Master of Computer Applications degree and hands-on experience in building scalable applications, I am confident in my ability to immediately contribute to your team.\r\nMy profile is centered around being an aspiring Full-stack and Backend Java Developer with experience in Java, SQL, and the MERN stack.I am skilled in developing REST APIs, utilizing Spring Boot, and implementing authentication workflows.  \r\nRelevant Experience and Skills\r\nMy qualifications align well with the requirements for a backend-focused role:\r\nJava and Frameworks: I have core proficiency in Java, SQL, and key frameworks like Hibernate and Spring Boot.  \r\nAPI Development: My experience includes developing over 20 REST APIs for accounts, sessions, and book management.  \r\nAuthentication & Security: I have secured transactions using JWT authentication.  \r\nProblem-Solving: I am passionate about problem-solving and focused on delivering real-world solutions.  \r\nDuring my Web Developer Intern role at HipsterSG India Pvt. Ltd., I gained practical experience in a fast-paced, mentor-driven environment.I utilized skills from my Summer Training in MERN Stack to develop a full-stack application and implement secure features.  \r\nI am eager to leverage my technical skills and enthusiasm for backend development to contribute to your projects. Thank you for considering my application. I have attached my resume for your detailed review and look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my skills can benefit your team.\r\nSincerely,\r\nRishabh Singh\r\nRae Bareli, Uttar Pradesh\r\n+91-9984821102\r\nrishabhs2088@gmail.com\r\nLinkedIn: linkedin.com/in/rishabh-singh2088  \r\nProject- Online Bookstore - https://book-store-app-psi-henna.vercel.app/', 'true', '2025-10-06', '12:16:01AM'),
