(1517, 'Dheeraj Upadhyay', 'dheerajup98@gmail.com', '7900932550', 'Any Other', 'fbdad85c1089c6ba525e5fa1d3cd56c9_resume.pdf', 'Passionate Full Stack Developer with 2 years of hands-on experience in building responsive web and mobile applications using React Native, React.js, Node.js, and MongoDB. Skilled in JavaScript (ES6+), TypeScript, HTML5, CSS3, and Redux, with a strong focus on performance optimization and clean architecture. Experienced in API integration, RESTful services, and Agile methodologies. Familiar with AWS, Firebase, and GraphQL, and proficient in deploying applications to both Play Store and App Store. Dedicated to delivering scalable, user-focused solutions that enhance business value.', 'true', '2025-10-07', '07:22:04PM'),
(1518, 'Abhishek Shukla', 'abhishekshukla28072004@gmail.com', '6394708766', 'Any Other', '6bf8f04979fcf9973ff1c45dd40c250b_resume.pdf', 'I am an experienced Web Developer with a strong background in Backend Development using Node.js and Frontend Development. I have worked on building and managing APIs, authentication, CRUD operations, and database management using MongoDB and Express.js.\r\nIn addition, I have hands-on experience as a WordPress Developer, where I customized themes, managed plugins, and developed responsive websites.\r\nI can efficiently handle both backend and frontend tasks to deliver complete and scalable web solutions.', 'true', '2025-10-08', '09:40:36AM'),
