(1529, 'Rishabh Singh', 'rishabhs2088@gmail.com', '09984821102', 'Any Other', 'a6f290afae8b763ef488983e3d6cb657_resume.pdf', 'Subject: Application for Backend Java Developer | Experienced in Spring Boot & Scalable SQL Architecture\r\n\r\nDear Hiring Team ,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my strong interest in the Backend Java Developer position. With experience in building secure, data-driven applications, I am confident in my ability to contribute to your Java development team.\r\n\r\nMy technical focus aligns directly with the backend requirements:\r\n\r\nCore Java & Spring Boot: Skilled in designing and deploying RESTful APIs, having implemented 15+ APIs during my internship, resulting in a 30% improvement in backend response efficiency.\r\n\r\nDatabase Management: Proficient in designing and managing data persistence layers using MySQL and implementing modular architecture, demonstrated in my Bank Account Management System project.\r\n\r\nSecurity: Expertise in authentication workflows, including engineering secure role-based access using JWT and bcrypt.\r\n\r\nMy resume, attached for your review, further details my practical experience and commitment to writing scalable, optimized code.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my Java and SQL skills can benefit your team.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\nRishabh Singh', 'true', '2025-10-13', '08:53:56PM'),
