(1537, 'yuvraj kumar', 'yuvrajsingh6554@gmail.com', '9102106278', 'Any Other', '3002775e434e43c2df318ed73ec00046_resume.pdf', 'Hi Ma’am/Sir,\r\nMy name is Yuvraj Kumar and I came across your company on DigiCoders career page. I am interested in applying for a suitable role in your organization related to Web Development, Python Development, or MERN Stack Development.\r\n\r\nI have hands-on experience in building full-stack projects, REST APIs, and scalable backend systems using MERN Stack, Python (Django), and Node.js. Currently, I am working as a Backend Developer at TVS Solutions where I develop production-level APIs, integrate payment systems, and manage application performance.\r\n\r\nI would be grateful if you could consider my profile for any current or upcoming opportunities at DigiCoders. Please find my resume and portfolio links below.\r\n\r\nPortfolio: https://yuvrajsinghmaurya.github.io/portfolio\r\n\r\nLinkedIn: https://www.linkedin.com/in/contactyuvrajkumar/\r\n\r\nResume: Attached\r\nContact: +91 9102106278\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your response.\r\nThank you!\r\nRegards,\r\nYuvraj Kumar', 'true', '2025-10-21', '02:05:14PM'),
