(1602, 'Saif Ali Khan', 'saif277207@gmail.com', '7379806767', 'Any Other', '82bee8c644f91b6c37ca3c00e84be3d3_resume.pdf', 'Hello Ma’am/Sir,\r\nMy name is Saif Ali. I am a MERN Stack Developer and I’m looking for a job opportunity.\r\nI have experience in React.js, Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB and building full-stack web applications.\r\nIf there is any opening in your company, please let me know. I would be happy to share my resume and project links.\r\nThank you.', 'true', '2025-11-27', '11:49:24AM'),
(1603, 'Saif Ali Khan', 'saif277207@gmail.com', '7379806767', 'Any Other', 'a3a911a7c51313adbc63617d3f819cb6_resume.pdf', 'Hello Ma’am/Sir,\r\nMy name is Saif Ali. I am a MERN Stack Developer and I’m looking for a job opportunity.\r\nI have experience in React.js, Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB and building full-stack web applications.\r\nIf there is any opening in your company, please let me know. I would be happy to share my resume and project links.\r\nThank you.', 'true', '2025-11-27', '11:49:30AM'),
(1604, 'Udit Narayan Saxena', 'udit9407@gmail.com', '7505266931', 'Any Other', '0d0c5c4619007c4395d4a7ceb9c9fe3c_resume.pdf', 'Dear Recruiter,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well.\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the Full-stack Developer position at your organization. I am a recent B.Tech graduate in Computer Science and Engineering from Dr. A.P.J. Abdul Kalam Technical University, with hands-on experience in building full-stack web applications using React.js, Node.js, Supabase, MongoDB, and Firebase.\r\n\r\nMy core skills include:\r\n\r\nFrontend: React.js, Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS\r\nBackend: Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, Firebase, Supabase\r\nAuth & Tools: Clerk, Firebase Auth, GitHub, Postman, Figma, Vercel\r\n\r\nI’m passionate about writing clean, maintainable code and building efficient, user-friendly applications. I am currently looking for a full-time opportunity that offers a 5-day working structure, as it supports a healthy work-life balance and consistent productivity.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, I am committed to relocating from Delhi NCR and am fully prepared to move to a new location as per the organization’s requirements.\r\n\r\nI would be grateful for the opportunity to discuss how my skills and enthusiasm can contribute to your team. Please find my portfolio and GitHub links below for your reference:\r\n\r\nhttp://portfolio-ljss.vercel.app/\r\nhttps://github.com/UDITNARYANSAXENA\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to hearing from you.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nUdit Narayan Saxena\r\n7505266931', 'true', '2025-11-28', '06:04:41PM'),
(1605, 'Srishti mani tripathi', 'Srishtitripathi77@gmail.com', '7380379762', 'Any Other', '6844ec13d285caaae6fc48c969ea5b09_resume.pdf', 'I’m Srishti Tripathi . I’m interested in a Web Developer internship. I know HTML, CSS, JS and basic React. Please consider me if any internship is available. Thank you.', 'true', '2025-11-29', '09:33:30AM'),
(1606, 'AZHARUDDIN SIDDIQUE', 'azharsiddique4590@gmail.com', '7310369472', 'Any Other', 'b5b23b72e33c4976100c02eaa1e85cef_resume.pdf', '\r\n\r\nTo\r\nThe HR Manager\r\nDigi coders\r\nLucknow\r\n\r\nSubject: Application for the Position of MERN stack\r\n\r\nSir/Madam,\r\n\r\nI am writing to express my interest in the position of MERN stack at your esteemed organization. I came across the job opening and believe that my skills, qualifications, and enthusiasm make me a suitable candidate for this role.\r\n\r\nI have completed BCA,and I possess strong knowledge in MERN stack  I am confident that my dedication, hard work, and willingness to learn will allow me to contribute positively to your team.\r\n\r\nI kindly request you to consider my application for the above-mentioned position. I would be grateful for an opportunity to attend an interview and discuss how I can be an asset to your organization.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\nYours sincerely\r\nAzharuddin Siddique\r\n7310369472\r\nazharsiddique@4590@gmail.com\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'true', '2025-11-29', '11:46:03PM'),
(1607, 'Sweta Gupta', 'shwetaguptag53@gmail.com', '8957886787', 'Any Other', 'b071f828a37e3d3f366c710586b730ba_resume.pdf', 'Dear Sir / Ma\'am,\r\n My name is Sweta Gupta, and I recently graduated with BTech in Computer Science with a specialization in Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning.\r\n\r\nWith a strong foundation in frontend development, I have honed my skills in React.js, JavaScript, and the MERN stack. Additionally, I have a good grasp of C++ and Generative AI. My 10-month internship experience as a Frontend Developer at Treleva Technologies has provided me with hands-on experience and industry insights and after that working in Faculty Path as a Backend developer .\r\n\r\nI came across your company and was impressed by the innovative work being done. Upon reviewing the job description for the Frontend Developer role, I believe my skills and experience make me a strong fit.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nSweta Gupta', 'true', '2025-11-30', '12:25:00AM'),
(1608, 'Ashutosh Pandey', 'ashumsccs2@gmail.com', '9807164408', 'Any Other', '77e04549e6ad6791292f9fd3d78d1a85_resume.pdf', 'Dear Hiring Manager,\r\n\r\nI’m a web developer with over 5+ years of experience building responsive, user-friendly websites using WordPress, PHP, MySQL, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Bootstrap and jQuery. I specialize in custom theme development, database-driven features, and optimizing site performance.\r\n\r\nSome highlights of my experience include:\r\n\r\n• Developing and launching over 20+ WordPress-based websites and 5+ Shopify Stores for clients across industries, from e-commerce to corporate portfolios\r\n\r\n•Integrating APIs and third-party services to enhance functionality, such as Jobs Application, CRMs, and marketing tools.\r\n\r\n• Implementing SEO best practices and performance optimization techniques, reducing load times by up to 40% on several projects.\r\n\r\nPreferred Start Date: I can Join Immediately \r\n\r\nI’d love the opportunity to bring my skills to your team and contribute to your web development efforts. Thank you for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\nThanks and Regards\r\nAshutosh Pandey\r\n\r\n', 'true', '2025-11-30', '05:53:11PM'),
(1609, 'ankit sonwani', 'ankitsonwani9559@gmail.com', '09559645654', 'Any Other', '140bdf120104bdf26b804d5b7caecc94_resume.pdf', 'i am php laravel devloper ', 'true', '2025-11-30', '10:05:56PM'),
(1610, 'Ayan Ali', 'ayaan8953@gmail.com', '8948937951', 'Any Other', '30a75d1a180d39bea1a0a72d4fcd342f_resume.pdf', 'I hope you are doing well. I am writing to express my interest in the Manual Testing / QA Engineer position at your organization. I have 2.5+ years of hands-on experience in manual testing of web and mobile applications, with strong knowledge of STLC, SDLC, and Defect Life Cycle.', 'true', '2025-12-01', '06:17:15PM'),
(1611, 'Manoj Kumar Maurya', 'mauryamanoj9334@gmail.com', '8858956947', 'Any Other', 'f91624501b2e989904919d4c1088fcc4_resume.pdf', 'hii sir ', 'true', '2025-12-02', '03:22:31PM'),
(1612, 'Osama khan', 'usamakhan7590@gmail.com', '6394426755', 'Any Other', '3c139f34727242fd296128365fbf593c_resume.pdf', 'I am applying for Laravel', 'true', '2025-12-02', '04:02:58PM'),
(1613, 'Pawan Singh', 'ios.pksingh91@gmail.com', '9795368192', 'Any Other', '991d0d38c6432d8b1570bd7f1a09c82c_resume.pdf', 'I hope this email finds you well. I am writing to express my interest in the iOS Developer position at your company, as advertised on your website. With a strong background in iOS development and a passion for creating innovative apps, I believe my skills align well with the requirements of the role.\r\n\r\nI have attached my resume for your review, and I would appreciate the opportunity to discuss how my experience and expertise can contribute to the success of your team\r\n\r\nThanks and Regards:\r\nPawan Singh\r\n', 'true', '2025-12-02', '07:25:22PM'),
(1614, 'Shivvishal Dubey ', 'shivvishaldubey02@gmail.com', '09695463705', 'Any Other', '54fed52813693fdcd59d549fa11b0318_resume.pdf', ' I hold a B.Tech in Computer Science and have hands-on experience in React.js development, JavaScript, Python, and backend technologies like Node.js and MongoDB. I have worked as a React Developer Intern, contributed to building real-world applications such as Zomify Eats and a live News Application, and recently trained at C-DAC Bengaluru in High Performance Computing with MPI, OpenMP, and parallel programming.\r\nAcross my internships at VidyaOne, Meru Accounting, and XenonStack, I worked on frontend development, API integrations, UI design, and gained strong exposure to software development lifecycle, Linux, Git, and Agile practices. I am confident that my technical skills, problem-solving approach, and ability to learn quickly make me a strong fit for this role.', 'true', '2025-12-02', '08:19:55PM'),
(1615, 'Mirza Faizan Beg', 'mf2067170@gmail.com', '9795173206', 'Any Other', 'e82b1b58403bf1668af52f756a95b766_resume.pdf', 'My Name is Mirza Faizan Beg, a B.Tech student at Maharana Pratap Engineering College. I have six months of experience working as a Subject Matter Expert at Chegg, where I help students understand complex physics concepts through clear, step-by-step explanations. I’m passionate about science, problem-solving, and continuous learning, and I enjoy applying theoretical knowledge to practical situations.', 'true', '2025-12-02', '09:53:36PM'),
(1616, 'AZHARUDDIN SIDDIQUE', 'azharsiddique4590@gmail.com', '07310369472', 'Any Other', 'd8004210fb4d0dc06a784460314a4763_resume.pdf', 'Subject: Application for Internship \r\nDear Sir/Madam, \r\nI hope you are doing well. \r\nMy name is Azharuddin Siddique , and I am currently pursuing MCA. I am writing to apply for an \r\ninternship in MERN stack at Digicoders . I am eager to gain practical experience and \r\nenhance my skills in Mern stack \r\nI would be grateful if you could consider my application for the internship opportunity. Please find \r\nmy resume attached. \r\nThank you for your time and consideration. \r\nSincerely, \r\nAzharuddin siddique \r\nPhone: 7310369472\r\nEmail: azharsiddique4590@gmail.com', 'true', '2025-12-03', '02:33:33AM');
