(12, 'Bikash Kumbhakar', 'bikashkumbhakar18.seoconsultant@gmail.com', '8509614358', 'For Digital Marketing', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI am full-time working on Search Engine Optimization. SEO Professional experienced in Guest Posting, and link building With my techniques.\r\nI can help you with how to get your desired rankings. My work is 100% original and SEO optimized.\r\n\r\nHere are my top HQ Blogs:-\r\nhttps://www.natureworldnews.com/	   DA 71  	DR 73\r\nhttp://Homebusinessmag.com/    DA 54	DR 73\r\nhttp://www.magpress.com/	DA 38	DR 73\r\nhttps://www.e-architect.com/	 DA 66    DR 72\r\nhttps://t2conline.com/	   DA 55    DR 72	\r\nhttps://retail-insider.com/	DA 53	DR 72\r\nhttps://www.talk-business.co.uk/	DA 48	DR 72\r\nhttp://www.dezzain.com/ 	    DA 40	       DR 72	\r\nhttps://www.feedster.com/	      DA 59     DR 71	\r\nhttps://www.itechpost.com/	DA 65	DR 70\r\n\r\nIf you would like to grow your network, secure guest posts, and find new opportunities within your industry, speak to us about our blog outreach opportunities today. \r\nI am looking forward to working with you.\r\n\r\nWarm Regards!', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2024-02-20', '11:52:48AM'),
