(24, 'Lisa white', 'lisa.white@mansurgarviel.com', '4242436660', 'For Digital Marketing', 'Hi,\r\nWe are from the international business department of Mansur Gavriel company. Our company is a high-end fashion handbag and accessory brand headquartered in New York, USA. With a global sales boom of more than 159% in the first quarter of 2024. The company is expanding its brand in India in the next 3 quarters. We are in need of cooperation with a reputable agency and understanding of your market to jointly research and deploy marketing campaigns on social networks. With the desire to expand the market, increase the number of new potential customers and explode in purchases.\r\nThe monthly marketing campaign budget for this market is $40,000 for the campaign pilot study period and can double if the campaign is successful.\r\nSee details of our brand and product information:\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/mansurgavriel/\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/mansurgavriel\r\n\r\nWe are waiting for your response via email to discuss this cooperation further.\r\nHave a nice day.', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2024-03-24', '07:55:54AM'),
