(28, 'Rohit Maurya', 'rohitmaurya9716@electronics.du.ac.in', '7217814079', 'Any Other', 'Hello Sir,\r\nI hope you will be fine. My name is Rohit Maurya from Uttar Pradesh. \r\nI have completed my graduation from Delhi University in Electronics (Hons). Currently, I am pursuing M.Sc. (Electronics) from Delhi University South Campus. \r\nI  have seen a post on Linked In where you mentioned your Summer training Internship for 45 days. When I click on the given link the Registration page is opened. In the Technology field, you add a course on Electronics-IOT and Electronics-Embedded. In the Electronics field if any vacancies are required please let me know.\r\nI want to share my knowledge with other students who are not from the Electronics field.\r\nI hope you will think about this topic.\r\nWaiting for your message...', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2024-04-07', '12:44:58PM'),
