(45, 'Shivam singh', 'shivamsingh856391@gmail.com', '8318533192', 'For Software Development', 'Hello Sir/Ma\'am,\r\nI am Shivam Singh a proficient Web Developer looking for an opportunity in your respected organization . I have experience in this domain as I have worked in few internship programs and I also posses the every skill set required for this job profile . And also I have been a Technical Lead at my college level.\r\n\r\nYou should hire me because I am consistent as well as hardworking and I am always curious to know and learn about the new upcoming technologies which keeps me ahead of others . \r\n\r\nThe work culture and learning attitude of company inspired me a lot to apply in this company , and more over the healthy environment it facilitates to its employees is quite good for there growth and its own .\r\n\r\nMy short term goal is to get connect with organizations where I can express my skills and knowledge which I have and to know & learn about new upcoming things .\r\n\r\nHopefully you will find me an suitable applicant for this job profile.\r\n\r\nMy projects drive link \r\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1N1NCg4LE2B8ritsrWtuZK3Sg8pDP9DzS', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2024-05-15', '10:21:55AM'),
