(47, 'Farheen', 'frmas5pd8amaarah@gmail.com', '8737045615', 'Any Other', 'Dear Hiring Manger,\r\n\r\nI hope this email finds you well.\r\n\r\n\r\nMy name is Farheen and I am writing to express my\r\ninterest at your company as a QA Software Test Engineer. \r\nAlthough I am a fresher in software testing, but I have a \r\nstrong knowledge of Software Manual Testing, Testing\r\nTechnique, Functional Testing, Performance Testing, Web\r\nTesting, API Testing, Mobile Testing, Jenkins, Scrum, \r\nPython, OOPs, Core Java, Agile Methodology, Git/GitHub \r\nProblem solving skills & I am currently practicing on these\r\ntesting technologies.\r\n\r\n\r\nI bring 3.3 years of experience in Quality Control and \r\nTechnical Support which has equipped me with a strong\r\nfoundation in Quality Control, Quality Assurance, \r\nProblem-solving, communication, Analytical thinking.\r\n\r\n\r\nI am confident that my dedication and enthusiasm will be\r\nvaluable assets to your team.\r\n\r\n\r\nI have attached my resume for your review. I would \r\nappreciate the opportunity to discuss how my background,\r\nskills and certifications can benefit your organization. \r\n\r\n\r\nThank you for considering my application.\r\n\r\nRegards\r\nFarheen \r\n8737045615', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2024-06-11', '04:16:15PM'),
