(62, 'Emily Smith', 'emilysmith@moscot-eu.com', '6465510184', 'Any Other', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI\'m Emily, representing MOSCOT Eyewear, a brand with a long history and passion for quality eyewear. We are looking to expand our presence in INDIA through a robust paid advertising campaign on social media platforms. We are seeking a service provider for this.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for three different partners to test with three different paid advertising budgets to expand our market:\r\n\r\nPartner 1 : $20,000 to $30,000 per month\r\nPartner 2 : $30,000 to $45,000 per month\r\nPartner 3 : $45,000 to $65,000 per month\r\nThe budget may increase if the campaign is effective for us, so please provide us with your price list and fees.\r\n\r\nYou can learn more about us on our website: https://moscot.com/pages/our-story\r\n\r\nWe would love to discuss how we can collaborate to create advertisements that not only stand out but also drive our growth goals. Please reply to my email so we can discuss this partnership further.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nEmily', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2024-08-08', '02:55:59PM'),
