(93, 'Hogan Recruitment Team', 'facebook@mkt-hogan.com', '8669065454', 'For Graphics Designing', 'Greetings. We are looking for an advertising team and freelance advertisers on Facebook, Instagram\r\n\r\nThe main job is to run ads and lead advertising campaigns as well as optimize advertising costs for footwear products. The advertising budget allocated to this project ranges from 50,000 USD to 100,000 USD. If it works, we are willing to double the sponsorship amount and establish a long-term cooperative relationship.\r\n\r\nDO YOU WANT TO BE A PART OF THE HOGAN?\r\n\r\nWorking with Hogan means growing within a dynamic and stimulating Group that drives innovation, creativity and continuous improvement, valuing diversity and the contribution of everyone.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for people who are willing to contribute to our success and know how to cherish important Hogan traditions. For Hogan, people are central.\r\n\r\nWe support a peaceful working environment, open to new ideas, promote change and value sharing and mutual exchange.\r\n\r\nWith the desire to increase sales and new customers, we are in need of experts with experience running Facebook ads in this market, to attract new customers to buy products through our Facebook page and Instagram page at a low cost. Good. the best. Fixed or negotiable salary from 5% - 15% of advertising budget\r\n\r\nFor more information, please visit:\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/Hogan\r\nhttps://www.hogan.com/\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/hoganbrand\r\n\r\nIf you are ready to explore this opportunity further, we are eager to learn more in detail to begin this collaborative effort. Please contact us by sending your CV or messaging via WhatsApp or Email.\r\n\r\nWhatsApp: +1 (866) 906-5454\r\nEmail: facebook@mkt-hogan.com\r\n\r\nWe extend our warmest regards and warmest regards,\r\nHogan Recruitment Team', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2024-09-24', '10:30:37AM'),
(94, 'Hogan Recruitment Team', 'facebook@mkt-hogan.com', '8669065454', 'For Mobile Application Development', 'Greetings. We are looking for an advertising team and freelance advertisers on Facebook, Instagram\r\n\r\nThe main job is to run ads and lead advertising campaigns as well as optimize advertising costs for footwear products. The advertising budget allocated to this project ranges from 50,000 USD to 100,000 USD. If it works, we are willing to double the sponsorship amount and establish a long-term cooperative relationship.\r\n\r\nDO YOU WANT TO BE A PART OF THE HOGAN?\r\n\r\nWorking with Hogan means growing within a dynamic and stimulating Group that drives innovation, creativity and continuous improvement, valuing diversity and the contribution of everyone.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for people who are willing to contribute to our success and know how to cherish important Hogan traditions. For Hogan, people are central.\r\n\r\nWe support a peaceful working environment, open to new ideas, promote change and value sharing and mutual exchange.\r\n\r\nWith the desire to increase sales and new customers, we are in need of experts with experience running Facebook ads in this market, to attract new customers to buy products through our Facebook page and Instagram page at a low cost. Good. the best. Fixed or negotiable salary from 5% - 15% of advertising budget\r\n\r\nFor more information, please visit:\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/Hogan\r\nhttps://www.hogan.com/\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/hoganbrand\r\n\r\nIf you are ready to explore this opportunity further, we are eager to learn more in detail to begin this collaborative effort. Please contact us by sending your CV or messaging via WhatsApp or Email.\r\n\r\nWhatsApp: +1 (866) 906-5454\r\nEmail: facebook@mkt-hogan.com\r\n\r\nWe extend our warmest regards and warmest regards,\r\nHogan Recruitment Team', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2024-09-24', '10:30:47AM'),
