(134, 'GAURAV SINGH', 'gaurravvsingh40@gmail.com', '8010884929', 'Any Other', 'Respected\r\n Sir / Madam\r\n\r\nI hope you are doing well. My name is Gaurav Udaypratap Singh, and I am a recent graduate in Bachelor of Engineering, \"Computer Engineering\" from Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Institute Of Technology . I am currently seeking job opportunities in Full-Stack Development and Data Analysis.\r\n\r\nDuring my studies, I worked on projects involving e-commerce platform development and charity-based web applications, which strengthened my skills in front-end and back-end development. Additionally, I have experience in data analysis, where I worked with tools like Python, SQL, and Excel to derive meaningful insights from data.\r\n\r\nI am eager to contribute my technical skills, problem-solving ability, and enthusiasm to a dynamic team. I would appreciate the opportunity to discuss how my skills align with any available positions. Please find my resume attached for your reference.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your response. Thank you for your time!\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nGAURAV UDAYPRATAP SINGH\r\n8010884929\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/gaurav-singh-416b42188/', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2025-02-24', '04:25:06AM'),
