(136, 'Geethanjali  Raju', 'geethanjali@wowgrowwth.com', '9538966838', 'For Software Development', 'Dear DigiCoders Technologies Private Limited Team,\r\n\r\nI’m reaching out on behalf of WowGrowth to explore a potential strategic alliance.\r\n\r\nMany businesses rely on referrals, but this approach is unpredictable and limits scalability. Sustainable growth requires a proactive strategy, yet most businesses excel in their domains—not in lead generation or marketing.\r\n\r\nWowGrowth acts as an outsourced growth partner, much like legal or auditing services. We bring:\r\n\r\n1. Processes – Proven methodologies for innovative outreach\r\n2. People – Experts in lead generation and marketing\r\n3. Tools – Specialized products, databases, and automation\r\n\r\nWith structured experimentation, targeted outreach, and scalable strategies, we help businesses engage their total addressable market effectively.\r\n\r\nLet’s discuss how WowGrowth can accelerate your growth.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nGeethanjali Raju, Strategic Alliances\r\n+91-95389-66838 \r\ngeethanjali@wowgrowwth.com ', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2025-03-04', '02:03:02PM'),
