(151, 'DIVYANSH PATEL', 'divyanshpatel40@gmail.com', '9161431585', 'For Website Development', 'DIVYANSH PATEL  \r\n531/35 Bhindia Tola Bara Chandganj,Lucknow  \r\ndivyanshpatel40@gmail.com\r\n9161431585  \r\n  \r\nDate:-24/04/2025\r\n\r\nHiring Manager\'s  \r\nDigi{Coders}\r\n2nd Floor, B-36, Sector O, Near Ram Ram Bank Chauraha, Aliganj, Lucknow, Uttar Pradesh, 226021\r\n                         I am writing to express my interest in the position of Front-end Developer at DigiCoders. As a recent graduate in BVOC(SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT AND E-GOVERNANCE) from NATIONAL POST GRADUATE COLLEGE, I am eager to bring my enthusiasm and knowledge to contribute to your innovative team.\r\nDuring my academic career, I developed strong foundations in HTML5, CSS, JavaScript, React, Node.js, Angular, Jquery. I completed a capstone project where I have make two E-commerce website full front-end page just like flipcart, which helped me improve my skills in HTML5, CSS, JavaScript, React, Node.js, Angular, Jquery. I also interned at DigiCoders where I gained hands-on experience in Making Front-end page of E-commerce Website.\r\nI would welcome the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your team. \r\nThank you for considering my application. I look forward to the possibility of speaking with you further.\r\n\r\nSincerely,  \r\nDIVYANSH PATEL\r\n\r\n\r\n', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2025-04-24', '02:22:54PM'),
