(158, 'Sneha Kumari', 'snehaku610@gmail.com', '7020167793', 'For Website Development', 'I am Sneha Kumari, a 3rd-year student at Padre Conceicao College of Engineering, Verna Goa, seeking a 2-month academic internship in UI/UX design or web development. Eager to apply my skills in real-world projects, I am passionate about creating intuitive interfaces and responsive web solutions. I am open to opportunities across other states to gain diverse industry exposure, embrace new challenges, and learn resilience in professional environments. This internship will help me grow while contributing meaningfully to your team.', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2025-05-03', '11:09:31AM'),
