(171, 'Sufyaan Ahmad ', '221897@kit.ac.in', '9336552403', 'Any Other', 'Dear Digi{coder} Team,\r\n\r\nI hope this message finds you well. My name is Sufyaan Ahmad, a B.Tech Computer Science student at Kanpur Institute of Technology. I am writing to express my keen interest in an internship opportunity at Digi{coder}.\r\n\r\nI have completed a full stack web development course and have hands-on experience in building several projects using technologies like React.js, Node.js, and MongoDB. Additionally, I hold certifications from AWS and Google Analytics and am passionate about applying my skills to real-world problems.\r\n\r\nI am particularly drawn to Digi{coder} for its innovative approach to technology and its vibrant development culture. I am eager to contribute to your team and grow as a developer under your mentorship.\r\n\r\nPlease find my resume attached. I would be grateful for the opportunity to discuss how I can contribute to your organization.\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\nWarm regards,\r\nSufyaan Ahmad', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2025-05-29', '07:29:11PM'),
