(176, 'Aman Shukla', 'dykonix@gmail.com', '9214072480', 'For Website Development', '1. Project Overview\r\nWe are building Ayurovedic, a platform that connects global patients to verified Ayurvedic hospitals, doctors, wellness centers, and treatments. The MVP will be a Progressive Web App (PWA) with location-based listings, disease search, doctor/hospital profiles, and patient features.\r\n\r\nWe’re looking to work with a mid-level development agency or experienced team to build the MVP. Design can be handled by your team or done externally depending on proposal strength.\r\n\r\n2. MVP Functional Scope\r\n???? Frontend Features\r\nHomepage with geo-location–based content\r\n\r\nSearch bar (disease, doctor, hospital, location)\r\n\r\nListings:\r\n\r\nHospitals\r\n\r\nDoctors\r\n\r\nWellness Centers\r\n\r\nDiseases\r\n\r\nProfile pages for:\r\n\r\nHospitals (with facilities like general ward, deluxe, testimonials, packages)\r\n\r\nDoctors (independent or attached to hospitals)\r\n\r\nWellness centers (treatments, therapies, locations)\r\n\r\nDisease pages with dynamic doctor/hospital recommendations\r\n\r\nEnquiry form + Free consultation request\r\n\r\nVerified testimonial system with document upload\r\n\r\nPatient account:\r\n\r\nBookmarks\r\n\r\nTrack consultations\r\n\r\nSubmit reviews\r\n\r\nRequest second opinion\r\n\r\n⚙️ Backend/Admin Features\r\nCMS to manage listings, testimonials, treatments\r\n\r\nEnquiry and consultation management\r\n\r\nDocument review/approval workflow for testimonials\r\n\r\nAdmin approval for all new hospital/doctor profiles\r\n\r\nDashboard analytics (basic – number of users, inquiries, reviews)\r\n\r\nLocation tagging (country, state, city)\r\n\r\nRole-based user permissions\r\n\r\n???? Tech Requirements\r\nFully responsive frontend (PWA) – Preferably built in React (Next.js)\r\n\r\nBackend API – Node.js (NestJS/Express) with MongoDB/PostgreSQL\r\n\r\nLocation APIs (Geo-IP)\r\n\r\nImage/document uploads (S3 or Firebase)\r\n\r\nDeployment to cloud (AWS/Vercel/DigitalOcean)\r\n\r\nSEO optimized structure\r\n\r\n3. Timeline\r\nTarget MVP Delivery: 8–10 weeks\r\n\r\nDesign: 2–3 weeks (if included)\r\n\r\nDevelopment & Testing: 6–7 weeks\r\n\r\n4. What to Include in Your Proposal\r\nPlease include the following:\r\n\r\nCompany profile (size, location, team structure)\r\n\r\nPortfolio (especially any healthcare/marketplace work)\r\n\r\nDetailed cost breakdown (design, frontend, backend, deployment)\r\n\r\nTimeline with milestones\r\n\r\nTech stack recommendation\r\n\r\nPost-launch support model (e.g., bug fixes for 1 month)\r\n\r\nCode handover + documentation strategy\r\n\r\nAny assumptions/exclusions', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2025-07-02', '08:22:56AM'),
(177, 'Ashutosh Singh Kushwaha', 'onlyashu20799@gmail.com', '8896772323', 'Any Other', 'My name is Ashutosh singh kushwaha, and I recently completed a 6-month internship as a Frontend Developer at rDvision.tech varanasi, where I worked on building responsive web applications using technologies like HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and React.js.\r\nI’m currently looking for a full-time opportunity where I can apply my skills, continue learning, and contribute to impactful projects. If there are any suitable openings in your organization, I would sincerely appreciate it if you could let me know.', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2025-07-09', '04:54:50PM'),
(178, 'Shebin Hassan', 'shebin@dependopolis.org', '9497865274', 'For Domain & Hosting', 'Hi,\r\n\r\nI\'m currently evaluating VPS providers and am specifically looking for plans that are backed by AMD EPYC Turin (9005 series) processors.\r\n\r\nCould you please confirm:\r\n\r\n       • Whether any of your current VPS plans run on EPYC Turin CPUs (e.g., 9354P, 9554P, 9654, etc.)?\r\n\r\n       • If so, could you share the exact model and typical vCore clock speeds offered in your 8–16 vCPU plans for VPS Hosting?\r\n\r\nI\'m focused on selecting a VPS based on actual CPU generation and performance characteristics, so this detail is essential to my decision.\r\n\r\nThank you in advance, and I look forward to your response..\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nShebin Hassan\r\nFounder & CEO, Dependopolis Consulting Limited\r\nshebin@dependopolis.org	', '', '', '', '', 'true', '2025-07-24', '11:57:28PM'),
