aseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">7. Make regular updates</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 14pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Verdana;color:#434343;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">The correct method for building an application and marketing it are two pieces of a three-section grid of a fruitful portable application. To wrap things up, the framework incorporates keeping up with the application after its delivery.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 14pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Verdana;color:#434343;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Almost certainly, you need your application to remain available assuming you\'re building it. That is the reason you ought to continue to further develop it. Recognize and fix bugs. Portable application clients demonstrated that 37% would quit utilizing an application assuming they experienced bugs like crashes, freezes, or rehashing mistakes, so ensure that each bug is fixed right away.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 14pt 0pt;\"> </p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;padding:0pt 0pt 14pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Verdana;color:#434343;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Likewise, stay up with the latest and add new elements. Consistent updates will likewise assist you with procuring more income. Adding highlights and fixing bugs will guarantee that your clients stay steadfast.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height:1.38;background-color:#ffffff;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:14pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Verdana;color:#434343;background-color:#ffffff;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Continually refreshing your application and breaking down every one of the information you gather is the way to client maintenance. Remember that 25% of clients leave an application after only one use. Along these lines, guarantee that you give your very best for keep your clients fulfilled.</span></p></b><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\">', '[{\"value\":\"Mobile App Development\"},{\"value\":\"Mobile Application Development\"}]', 'true', '2022-07-12', '05:39:59PM');
