(1037, 'Shailja Gupta', 'shailjagupta18@gmail.com', '8269670508', 'Any Other', '1070e594419de30ebbb1aef666cfa9d1_resume.pdf', 'Hi There\r\nI’m Shailja Gupta (immediate joiner), with 6+ years of experience as a Project Coordinator and Business Analyst. I\'ve been impressed with the work your company has been doing in Product and service based apps and webs.\r\n\r\nI’m extremely interested in contributing to your team.\r\n\r\nI would love the chance to discuss how my experience can support DigiCoders in the Project Coordinator or Business Analyst role, or any other openings that may align with my background.', 'true', '2025-03-24', '06:23:19PM'),
